helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090202.xhp	0	help	par_id3149482				0	gl	instrucións				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090202.xhp	0	help	par_id3147124				0	gl	If condición = verdadeira Then Exit For				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090202.xhp	0	help	par_id3153159				0	gl	instrucións				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090202.xhp	0	help	par_id3154096				0	gl	Seguinte				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090202.xhp	0	help	par_id3156286				0	gl	Note: In nested \<emph\>For...Next\</emph\> loops, if you exit a loop unconditionally with \<emph\>Exit For\</emph\>, only one loop is exited.				20200411 15:09:53
