helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03131700.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153255				0	gl	\<bookmark_value\>GetProcessServiceManager function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>ProcessServiceManager\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03131700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153255				0	gl	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03131700.xhp\" name=\"GetProcessServiceManager Function [Runtime]\"\>GetProcessServiceManager Function [Runtime]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03131700.xhp	0	help	par_id3156414				0	gl	Devolve o ProcessServiceManager (central Uno ServiceManager).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03131700.xhp	0	help	par_id3145136				0	gl	Esta función necesítase se desexa crear a instancia dun servizo mediante CreateInstanceWithArguments.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03131700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153681				0	gl	Sintaxe:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03131700.xhp	0	help	par_id3151110				0	gl	oServiceManager = GetProcessServiceManager()				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03131700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149516				0	gl	Exemplo:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03131700.xhp	0	help	par_id3143270				0	gl	oServiceManager = GetProcessServiceManager()				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03131700.xhp	0	help	par_id3153825				0	gl	oIntrospection = oServiceManager.createInstance("com.sun.star.beans.Introspection");				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03131700.xhp	0	help	par_id3148473				0	gl	é o mesmo que a seguinte instrución:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03131700.xhp	0	help	par_id3145609				0	gl	oIntrospection = CreateUnoService("com.sun.star.beans.Introspection")				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020500.xhp	0	help	tit				0	gl	Bibliotecas, módulos e caixas de diálogo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147317				0	gl	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/01020500.xhp\" name=\"Libraries, Modules and Dialogs\"\>Libraries, Modules and Dialogs\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020500.xhp	0	help	par_id3147427				0	gl	A continuación descríbese o uso básico de bibliotecas, módulos e caixas de diálogo en $[officename] Basic.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020500.xhp	0	help	par_id3146120				0	gl	$[officename] Basic proporciona ferramentas para axudalo a estruturar os seus proxectos. Admite diversas "unidades" que permiten agrupar SUBS e FUNCTIONS individuais nun proxecto de Basic.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148575				0	gl	Bibliotecas				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020500.xhp	0	help	par_id3150011				0	gl	As bibliotecas serven como ferramenta para organizar módulos e poden anexarse a un documento ou modelo. Cando gardamos o documento ou modelo, tamén se gardan os módulos contidos na biblioteca.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020500.xhp	0	help	par_id3151112				0	gl	As bibliotecas conteñen ata 16.000 módulos.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149262				0	gl	Módulos				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020500.xhp	0	help	par_id3156441				0	gl	Un módulo contén SUBS ou FUNCTIONS xunto con declaracións de variábeis. O tamaño do programa que se pode gardar nun módulo está limitado a 64 KB. Se fose necesario máis espazo, divida o proxecto de $[officename] Basic en varios módulos e, despois, gárdeos nunha única biblioteca.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152577				0	gl	Módulos de caixas de diálogo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149377				0	gl	Os módulos de caixas de diálogo conteñen as definicións de diálogo e, inclusive, as propiedades de caixa de diálogo, as propiedades de cada elemento e os eventos atribuídos. Como os módulos de caixas de diálogo só conteñen unha caixa, normalmente chámanse "diálogos".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\00000003.xhp	0	help	tit				0	gl	Información				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\00000003.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148550				0	gl	Información				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\00000003.xhp	0	help	par_id3153381				0	gl	You can set the locale used for controlling the formatting numbers, dates and currencies in $[officename] Basic in \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Language Settings - Languages\</emph\>. In Basic format codes, the decimal point (\<emph\>.\</emph\>) is always used as \<emph\>placeholder\</emph\> for the decimal separator defined in your locale and will be replaced by the corresponding character.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\00000003.xhp	0	help	par_id3150870				0	gl	Aplícase o mesmo na configuración rexional dos formatos de data, hora e moneda. O código de formato de Basic interpretarase e mostrarase de acordo coa súa configuración rexional.				20200411 15:09:53
