helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030102.xhp	0	help	par_id3150542				0	gl	Returns a date value from a date string. The date string is a complete date in a single numeric value. You can also use this serial number to determine the difference between two dates.				20200411 15:09:53
