helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152576				0	gl	Dim declara as variábeis locais dentro de métodos. As variábeis globais decláranse coa instrución PUBLIC ou PRIVATE.				20200411 15:09:53
