helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\show_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3152596				0	gl	Sen utilizar "LoadDialog" pode activar o código da seguinte forma:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\show_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3163710				0	gl	Sub MostrarDiálogo1				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\show_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3146985				0	gl	DialogLibraries.LoadLibrary( "Standard" )				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\show_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3155418				0	gl	oDialog1 = CreateUnoDialog( DialogLibraries.Standard.Dialog1 )				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\show_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3154944				0	gl	oDialog1.Execute()				20200411 15:09:53
