helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159224				0	gl	\<ahelp visibility=\"visible\" hid=\"HID_OFA_HYPERLINK_SEARCH\"\>Click and choose one of the Internet search engines from the submenu. The search term is entered in the \<emph\>URL Name\</emph\> box.\</ahelp\> The list of search engines in the \<emph\>Find\</emph\> submenu is defined in \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01020200.xhp\" name=\"Internet - Search\"\>Internet - Search\</link\>\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
