helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\18010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148520				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SelectObject\"\>Allows you to select objects in the current document.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\18010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149511				0	gl	\<image id=\"img_id3159194\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_drawselect.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3159194\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\18010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147571				0	gl	Selección				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\18010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155555				0	gl	To select an object, click the object with the arrow. To select more than one object, drag a selection frame around the objects. To add an object to a selection, press Shift, and then click the object. \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"CHART\"\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"MATH\"\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>The objects selected together can then be defined as a \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05290000.xhp\" name=\"group\"\>group\</link\>, turning them into a single group object.\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\18010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3143267				0	gl	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"CHART\"\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"MATH\"\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>You can edit individual elements of a group. You can also delete elements from a group with \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Shift\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+click.\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\18010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3166460				0	gl	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"CALC\"\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"CHART\"\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"MATH\"\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>You can select single objects from a group by double-clicking, if you first disable the \<emph\>Double-click to edit Text\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Option\</emph\> Bar.\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	tit				0	gl	Suxestións especiais para controis de táboa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	bm_id3109850				0	gl	\<bookmark_value\>controis de táboa; propiedades\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>controis; propiedades de controis de táboa\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>controis de táboa; modo de edición só por teclado\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	hd_id3109850				0	gl	Suxestións especiais para controis de táboa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3153539				0	gl	Pode definir un control de táboa para mostrar os rexistros como prefira. Por outras palabras, pode definir campos de datos para mostrar ou editar datos da mesma maneira que nun formulario de base de datos.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3152372				0	gl	The following fields are possible in a table control: text, date, time and currency field, numeric field, pattern field, check box and combo box. In the case of combined date/time fields, two columns are created automatically.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3159194				0	gl	O número de liñas seleccionadas, se hai, sitúase entre parénteses despois do número total de rexistros.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3155616				0	gl	Para inserir unha columna no control de táboa, prema na súa cabeceira e abra o menú de contexto. Están dispoñíbeis as seguintes ordes:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150789				0	gl	Inserir columna				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3153750				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_FM_INSERTCOL\"\>Abre un submenú para seleccionar un campo de datos e incorporalo no control de táboa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3155552				0	gl	Configure o control de táboa arrastrando e soltando. Abra o explorador da fonte de datos e arrastre os campos desexados ao inicio da columna do control de táboa. Crearase unha columna preconfigurada.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149827				0	gl	Substituír por				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3153345				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_FM_CHANGECOL\"\>Abre un submenú para seleccionar un campo de datos que substitúa o campo de datos seleccionado no control de táboa.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143267				0	gl	Eliminar columna				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3157958				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_FM_DELETECOL\"\>Elimina a columna seleccionada.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147275				0	gl	Columna				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3152996				0	gl	Abre a caixa de diálogo de propiedades da columna seleccionada.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148539				0	gl	Ocultar columnas				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3159157				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_FM_HIDECOL\"\>Oculta a columna seleccionada.\</ahelp\> As súas propiedades non se modifican.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150771				0	gl	Mostrar columnas				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3159400				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_FM_SHOWCOLS\"\>Abre un submenú onde pode seleccionar as columnas que desexa mostrar de novo.\</ahelp\> Para mostrar só unha columna, prema no seu nome. Só pode ver as primeiras 16 columnas ocultas. Se hai máis, escolla a orde \<emph\>Máis\</emph\> para abrir a caixa de diálogo \<emph\>Mostrar columnas\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156193				0	gl	Máis				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3159269				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_FM_SHOWCOLS_MORE\"\>Abre a caixa de diálogo \<emph\>Mostrar columnas\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3149763				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:LISTBOX:RID_SVX_DLG_SHOWGRIDCOLUMNS:1\"\>In the \<emph\>Show Columns\</emph\> dialog you can select the columns to be shown. Hold down the Shift or Ctrl (Mac: Command) key to select multiple entries.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153561				0	gl	Todo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3150504	87			0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_FM_SHOWALLCOLS\"\>Prema \<emph\>Todo\</emph\> se quere mostrar todas as columnas.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153349				0	gl	Control só por teclado dos controis de táboa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3149416				0	gl	If you use the keyboard only to travel through controls in your document, you will find one difference to the other types of controls: the Tab key does not move the cursor to the next control, but moves to the next column inside the table control. Press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Tab to move to the next control, or press Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Tab to move to the previous control.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153062				0	gl	Para entrar no modo edición especial só por teclado para controis de táboa:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3144510				0	gl	O documento de formulario debe estar en \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170500.xhp\" name=\"modo deseño\"\>modo deseño\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3154758				0	gl	Press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+F6 to select the document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3161657				0	gl	Prema Maiús+F4 para seleccionar o primeiro control. Se o control de táboa non é o primeiro, prema Tab ata seleccionalo.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3151056				0	gl	Prema Intro para entrar no modo edición. As agarradoiras móstranse afastadas do bordo do control.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3154938				0	gl	Prema Maiús+F10 para abrir o menú de contexto do modo edición.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3154365				0	gl	If you want to edit columns, press Shift+Space to enter column edit mode. Now you can rearrange the order of columns with \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Arrow keys. The Delete key deletes the current column.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3145419				0	gl	Prema na tecla Esc para saír do modo edición.				20200411 15:09:53
