helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3152886				0	gl	Cando a caixa de verificación \<emph\>Expresión comodín\</emph\> está marcada, esta función non está dispoñíbel.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149664				0	gl	Aplicar formato de campo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3146975				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SEARCH_FORMATTER\"\>Especifica que se teñen en conta os formatos de campo ao efectuar buscas no documento actual.\</ahelp\> Os formatos de campo son formatos visíbeis que se crean de acordo coas seguintes posibilidades:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150103				0	gl	en modo deseño de táboa nas propiedades de campo,				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150488				0	gl	na visualización de fontes de datos por medio do formatado de columnas,				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3152941				0	gl	en formularios por medio das propiedades de control.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3156736				0	gl	Se marcou a caixa \<emph\>Aplicar formato de campo\</emph\>, a busca na visualización de fonte de datos da táboa ou formulario realízase empregando o formato que configurou nela. Se non a marcou, búscase empregando o formato gardado na base de datos.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3151280				0	gl	Exemplo:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149959				0	gl	You have a date field, which is saved in "DD.MM.YY" format in the database (for example, 17.02.65). The format of the entry is changed in the data source view to "DD MMM YYYY" (17 Feb 1965). Following this example, a record containing February 17 is only found when the \<emph\>Apply field format\</emph\> option is on:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150593				0	gl	Aplicar formato de campo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3145253				0	gl	Search pattern				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3083279				0	gl	activado				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155850				0	gl	encóntrase "ago", mais non "8".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3148590				0	gl	desactivado				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153418				0	gl	encóntrase "8", mais non "Ago".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3151321				0	gl	Recoméndase buscar sempre co formato de campo.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149401				0	gl	Ao buscar sen formato de campo poden xurdir algúns problemas que dependen da base de datos utilizada e que acontecen só con certos formatos internos predefinidos. Vexa os seguintes exemplos:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3152971				0	gl	Search results				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154273				0	gl	Causa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153836				0	gl	"5" devolve a hora "14:00:00"				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3156332				0	gl	Time fields are not defined for dBASE databases and must be simulated. To internally display the time "14:00:00", a 5 is necessary.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3157965				0	gl	"00:00:00" devolve os rexistros dun campo estándar de data				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3146081				0	gl	A base de datos almacena internamente un valor de data por medio dun campo combinado de data/hora.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155764				0	gl	"45,79" non devolve "45,79", aínda que seleccione a opción \<emph\>campo completo\</emph\> en \<emph\>Posición\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155518				0	gl	A visualización mostrada non coincide co almacenado internamente. Por exemplo, se almacena o valor 45,789 na base de datos como campo de tipo Número/Duplo e o formato visíbel está configurado para mostrar só dous decimais, o valor "45,79" só se devolve en buscas con formato de campo.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3148481				0	gl	In this case, standard formatting is formatting that refers to the internally stored data. It is not always visible to the user, especially if it is used for simulating data types (for example, time fields in dBASE databases). This depends on the database used and the individual data type. Searching with field formatting is appropriate if you only want to find what is actually shown. This includes fields of type Date, Time, Date/Time and Number/Double.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154507	31			0	gl	No entanto, as buscas sen \<emph\>Aplicar formato de campo \</emph\>son adecuadas para campos de bases de datos grandes sen problemas de formato, por seren máis rápidas.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153355				0	gl	If you are searching the values of check boxes, and \<emph\>Apply field format\</emph\> is on, then you will receive a "1" for marked check boxes, a "0" for unmarked check boxes, and an empty string for undefined (tristate) check boxes. If the search has been carried out with \<emph\>Apply field format\</emph\> set to off, you will see the language-dependent default values "TRUE" or "FALSE".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150995	119			0	gl	Se utiliza \<emph\>Aplicar formato de campo\</emph\> ao buscar en caixas de lista, o texto móstrase en caixas de lista. Se non utiliza \<emph\>Aplicar formato de campo\</emph\>, o contido correspóndese co formato de campo estándar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150387				0	gl	Diferenciar maiúsculas de minúsculas				20200411 15:09:53
