helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153760				0	gl	The graphic object is shown in grayscale. A color graphic object can become monochrome in grayscale. You can also use the color sliders to apply a uniform color to the monochrome graphic object.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151246				0	gl	Branco e negro				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153062				0	gl	O obxecto gráfico móstrase en branco e negro. Os valores de brillo por debaixo de 50% aparecen en negro e os por enriba de 50% aparecen en branco.				20200411 15:09:53
