helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_id3145357				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_EMPTY_IS_NULL\"\>Defines how an empty string input should be handled. If set to Yes, an input string of length zero will be treated as a value NULL. If set to No, any input will be treated as-is without any conversion.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_id0820200812403467				0	gl	An empty string is a string of length zero (""). Normally, a value NULL is not the same as an empty string. In general, a term NULL is used to denote an undefined value, an unknown value, or "no value has been entered yet."				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_id0820200812403455				0	gl	Database systems vary and they might handle a value NULL differently. Refer to documentations of the database that you are using.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	hd_id3161653				0	gl	Proposta de filtro				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_id3151221	89			0	gl	\<variable id=\"filtervorschlag\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_FILTERPROPOSAL\"\>Ao deseñar o seu formulario pode definir a propiedade "Proposta de filtro" para cada caixa de texto do separador \<emph\>Datos\</emph\> da caixa de diálogo \<emph\>Propiedades\</emph\> correspondente. Nas seguintes buscas en modo filtro, pode utilizar toda a información contida neses campos.\</ahelp\> O contido do campo pode seleccionarse mediante a función Completar automaticamente. No entanto, teña en conta que esta función require unha maior cantidade de espazo de memoria e de tempo, especialmente cando se utiliza en bases de datos grandes, polo que debe usarse con moderación. \</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_idN10EE3				0	gl	Cela ligada				20200411 15:09:53
