helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148643				0	gl	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170103.xhp\" name=\"Eventos\"\>Eventos\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3152350	2			0	gl	No separador\<emph\> Eventos \</emph\>pode ligar macros a eventos que acontecen nos campos de control dun formulario.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3155419				0	gl	Cando ten lugar o evento chámase a macro ligada. Para atribuír unha macro a un evento, prema no botón \<emph\>...\</emph\>. Abrirase a caixa de diálogo \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05060700.xhp\" name=\"Atribuír macro\"\>Atribuír macro\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3149732				0	gl	Existen diferentes eventos dispoñíbeis en función do control. No separador \<emph\>Eventos\</emph\> só se listan os dispoñíbeis. Están definidos os seguintes eventos:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149191				0	gl	Aprobar unha acción				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3153717				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_APPROVEACTIONPERFORMED\"\>This event takes place before an action is triggered by clicking the control.\</ahelp\> For example, clicking a "Submit" button initiates a send action; however, the actual "send" process is started only when the \<emph\>When initiating\</emph\> event occurs. The \<emph\>Approve action\</emph\> event allows you to kill the process. If the linked method sends back FALSE, \<emph\>When initiating\</emph\> will not be executed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156024				0	gl	Executar unha acción				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3145609				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_ACTIONPERFORMED\"\>The \<emph\>Execute action\</emph\> event occurs when an action is started.\</ahelp\> For example, if you have a "Submit" button in your form, the send process represents the action to be initiated.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156343				0	gl	Modificado				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3148755	42			0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_CHANGED\"\>O evento \<emph\>Modificado\</emph\> acontece cando se modifica o contido do control tras deixar de estar este enfocado.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153524				0	gl	Texto modificado				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150495	11			0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_TEXTCHANGED\"\>O evento \<emph\>Texto modificado\</emph\> acontece se se introduce ou modifica un texto nun campo de entrada.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154123				0	gl	Estado modificado				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150870	9			0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_ITEMSTATECHANGED\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>O evento \<emph\>Estado modificado\</emph\> acontece se se modifica o estado do campo de control.\</ahelp\>O evento \<emph\>Estado modificado\</emph\> acontece se se modifica o estado do campo de control.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151176				0	gl	Ao recibir o foco				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3154218	17			0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_FOCUSGAINED\"\>O evento \<emph\>Ao recibir o foco\</emph\> acontece cando se enfoca un campo de control.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150447				0	gl	Ao perder o foco				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3159252	19			0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_FOCUSLOST\"\>O evento \<emph\>Ao perder o foco\</emph\> acontece cando un campo de control deixa de estar enfocado.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147287				0	gl	Tecla premida				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3152940	21			0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_KEYTYPED\"\>O evento \<emph\>Tecla premida\</emph\> acontece cando o usuario preme calquera tecla mentres o control está enfocado.\</ahelp\> Este evento pode estar ligado a unha macro de verificación de entradas.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154127				0	gl	Tecla liberada				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3154150	44			0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_KEYUP\"\>The\<emph\> Key released \</emph\>event occurs when the user releases any key while the control has the focus.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154921				0	gl	Rato dentro				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3148618	27			0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_MOUSEENTERED\"\>O evento \<emph\>Rato dentro\</emph\> acontece se o rato está dentro do campo de control.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148576				0	gl	Movemento do rato con tecla premida				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3155411	31			0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_MOUSEDRAGGED\"\>The\<emph\> Mouse moved while key pressed \</emph\>event takes place when the mouse is dragged while a key is pressed.\</ahelp\> An example is when, during drag-and-drop, an additional key determines the mode (move or copy).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149262				0	gl	Movemento do rato				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3146975	33			0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_MOUSEMOVED\"\>O evento \<emph\>Movemento do rato\</emph\> acontece ao mover o rato sobre o control..\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159197				0	gl	Botón do rato premido				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3145271	23			0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_MOUSEPRESSED\"\>O evento \<emph\>Botón do rato premido\</emph\> acontece ao premer o botón do rato mentres o apuntador está situado sobre o control.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_idN108BD				0	gl	Note that this event is also used for notifying requests for a popup context menu on the control.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148880				0	gl	Botón do rato liberado				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150659	25			0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_MOUSERELEASED\"\>O evento \<emph\>Botón do rato liberado\</emph\> acontece ao liberar o botón do rato mentres o apuntador está situado sobre o control.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156286				0	gl	Rato fóra				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3149582	29			0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_MOUSEEXITED\"\>O evento \<emph\>Rato fóra\</emph\> acontece cando o rato está fóra do campo de control.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
