helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id0514200811525591				0	gl	In current versions, you can select to save your documents using ODF 1.2 (default) or ODF 1.0/1.1 (for backward compatibility). Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - Options - Load/Save - General\</item\> and select the ODF format version.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_idN107E9				0	gl	If you want to exchange documents with users that still use OpenOffice.org 1 or StarOffice 7, save the document using the respectively named filter in the \<emph\>File type\</emph\> listbox.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3146907				0	gl	If you want to define another file format as the default, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010200.xhp\" name=\"Load/Save - General\"\>Load/Save - General\</link\>\</emph\> to find alternative file formats for each $[officename] document type.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150398				0	gl	Estrutura de ficheiro XML				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3149649				0	gl	Os documentos co formato de ficheiro OpenDocument son almacenados como ficheiros zip comprimidos que conteñen ficheiros XML. Para ver eses ficheiros XML, abra o ficheiro OpenDocument cun programa de descompresión. Os seguintes ficheiros e cartafoles están contidos nos ficheiros OpenDocument:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3153178				0	gl	O contido textual do documento está localizado en \<emph\>content.xml\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3154068				0	gl	By default, \<emph\>content.xml\</emph\> is stored without formatting elements like indentation or line breaks to minimize the time for saving and opening the document. On the \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Load/Save - General\</emph\> tab page you can activate the use of indentations and line breaks by clearing the check box \<emph\>Size optimization for ODF format\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3145152				0	gl	O ficheiro \<emph\>meta.xml\</emph\> contén a metainformación do documento, que se pode introducir en \<emph\>Ficheiro - Propiedades\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3150740	33			0	gl	Se se garda un documento con contrasinal, \<emph\>meta.xml\</emph\> non se crifa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3150391				0	gl	O ficheiro \<emph\>settings.xml\</emph\> contén información adicional sobre a configuración deste documento.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3150447	35			0	gl	En \<emph\>styles.xml,\</emph\> encontrará os estilos aplicados ao documento que se poden ver na xanela Estilos e formatado.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3153353	36			0	gl	O ficheiro \<emph\>meta-inf/manifest.xml\</emph\> describe a estrutura do ficheiro XML.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3153368				0	gl	Pode haber ficheiros e cartafoles adicionais dentro do formato de ficheiro comprimido.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154299				0	gl	Definición de formatos XML				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_idN10AAD				0	gl	O esquema para os formatos OpenDocument encóntranse no sitio web \<link href=\"http://www.oasis-open.org\"\>www.oasis-open.org\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3149561				0	gl	The DTD (Document Type Description) files for the older formats can be found in the installation folder.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3152596				0	gl	Note that the formats are subject to certain licenses. You can find notes on the licenses at the start of the DTD files. More detailed information can be found on the \<link href=\"https://www.openoffice.org\" name=\"Apache OpenOffice\"\>Apache OpenOffice\</link\> website.				20200411 15:09:53
