helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_edit.xhp	0	help	par_idN10834				0	gl	Na caixa de diálogo, seleccione os novos atributos e prema \<emph\>Aceptar\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_edit.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147530				0	gl	Editar botóns de hiperligazón				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3152361				0	gl	If the hyperlink is a button, click on the border to select it, or press the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> key while clicking. Open the \<emph\>Properties\</emph\> dialog through the context menu. You can edit the label text under "Caption," and modify the address in the "URL" field.				20200411 15:09:53
