helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B5				0	gl	Click the Fontwork object. If the Fontwork object is inserted in the background, hold down the Ctrl key while you click.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B8				0	gl	Móstrase a barra de ferramentas \<link href=\"text/shared/fontwork_toolbar.xhp\"\>\<emph\>Fontwork\</emph\>\</link\>. Se non a ve, escolla \<emph\>Ver - Barras de ferramentas - Fontwork\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
