helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3156329				0	gl	Premer en F6 repetidamente redirecciona o foco cara aos seguintes obxectos:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3150669				0	gl	barra de menú,				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3149234				0	gl	todas as barras de ferramentas de arriba cara a abaixo e da esquerda cara á dereita,				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3147618				0	gl	cada xanela libre da esquerda cara á dereita,				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3154514				0	gl	documento				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3153252				0	gl	Press Shift+F6 to switch through objects in the opposite direction.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3152473				0	gl	Press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+F6 to switch to the document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3152360				0	gl	Prema F10 para alternar á barra de menús e volver.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3153896				0	gl	A tecla Esc pecha un submenú aberto, unha barra de ferramentas ou a actual xanela libre.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3161656				0	gl	Chamar ordes de menú				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3151056				0	gl	Press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> or F6 or F10 to select the first menu (the \<emph\>File\</emph\> menu). With right arrow, the next menu to the right is selected; with left arrow, the previous menu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3153381				0	gl	A frecha cara a abaixo abre o menú seleccionado. As frechas cara a abaixo e cara a arriba desprazan a selección a través das ordes de menú e a frecha cara á dereita abre os submenús existentes.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3148798				0	gl	Prema Intro para executar a orde de menú seleccionado.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147086				0	gl	Executar ordes de icona				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3148922				0	gl	Prema F6 repetidamente ata seleccionar a primeira icona da barra de ferramentas. Utilice as frechas cara á dereita e cara á esquerda para seleccionar unha icona nunha barra de ferramentas horizontal. Da mesma forma, utilice as frechas cara a arriba e cara a abaixo para seleccionar unha icona nunha barra de ferramentas vertical. A tecla Inicio selecciona a primeira icona situada nunha barra de ferramentas e a tecla Fin a última.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3144433				0	gl	Press Enter to execute the selected icon. If the selected icon normally demands a consecutive mouse action, such as inserting a rectangle, then pressing the Enter key is not sufficient: in these cases press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Enter.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3153968				0	gl	Pressing \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Enter on an icon for creating a draw object. A draw object will be placed into the middle of the view, with a predefined size.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3150449				0	gl	Press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Enter on the Selection tool to select the first draw object in the document. If you want to edit, size, or move the selected draw object, first use \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+F6 to set the focus into the document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3151041				0	gl	Se unha barra de ferramentas é máis longa que o visualizábel en pantalla, móstrase unha icona no bordo dereito ou no inferior. Seleccione a barra de ferramentas e prema Re Páx ou Av Páx para ver as iconas restantes.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150440				0	gl	Suxestións especiais para barras de ferramentas				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3149983				0	gl	Prema a tecla de frecha cara a abaixo ou cara á dereita para abrir a barra de ferramentas seleccionada, o que equivale a premer unha vez co rato. Na barra de ferramentas, use as frechas cara á dereita e cara á esquerda. As teclas Inicio e Fin seleccionan, respectivamente, a primeira e a última icona da barra.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3145365				0	gl	Utilice a tecla Esc para pechar a barra de ferramentas, para movela necesítase un rato.				20200411 15:09:53
