helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3153707				0	gl	Press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift+F10.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154479				0	gl	Seleccionar obxectos				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3148993				0	gl	Press Shift+F4 to select the first object in the current document. When an object is selected, press Tab to select the next object, or press Esc to go back to the text.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152962				0	gl	Editar obxectos				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3156379				0	gl	Os obxectos OLE seleccionados poden activarse coa tecla Intro.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155766				0	gl	Editar a posición e o tamaño dos obxectos				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3148405				0	gl	Use as teclas de frecha para mover o obxecto seleccionado unha unidade de resolución na grade.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3145619				0	gl	Set the grid resolution unit with \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - Grid\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Resolution\</emph\> area. If you enter a number greater than 1 in the \<emph\>Subdivision\</emph\> area, you must press the arrow key as often as the number states to move the selected object by one grid resolution unit.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3166450				0	gl	Use the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> and arrow keys to move the selected object by one pixel.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3147345				0	gl	Use \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Tab to enter the handle edit mode. The upper left handle is the active handle, it starts blinking. Use \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Tab to select the next handle. Press Escape to exit the handle edit mode.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3149565				0	gl	No modo edición de agarradoiras, as teclas de frecha moven a agarradoira seleccionada, alterando o tamaño do obxecto.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147361				0	gl	Editar a áncora dos obxectos				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3148534				0	gl	Pode mover a áncora dun obxecto coas teclas de frecha. Primeiro entre no modo edición de agarradoiras e seleccione a áncora, dependendo do tipo poderá movela en diferentes direccións.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3163808				0	gl	Seleccione o obxecto.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3150646				0	gl	Enter the handle edit mode with \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3150940				0	gl	The upper left handle starts blinking. Press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Tab several times, until no handle blinks. This signals that now the anchor of the object is activated. \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>In text documents you can press Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+A to activate the anchor directly.\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3153919				0	gl	Use as teclas de frecha para mover a áncora. O obxecto acompáñaa correctamente.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3152582				0	gl	Pode cambiar a áncora do obxecto seleccionado, por exemplo, no menú de contexto do obxecto.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3148393				0	gl	Se o obxecto está ancorado \<emph\>ao parágrafo\</emph\>, as teclas de frecha móveno ao parágrafo anterior ou ao seguinte.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3145615	69			0	gl	Se o obxecto está ancorado \<emph\>á páxina\</emph\>, as teclas Re Páx e Av Páx móveno á páxina anterior e á posterior, respectivamente.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3145135				0	gl	Se o obxecto está ancorado \<emph\>ao carácter\</emph\>, as teclas de frecha móveno a través do parágrafo actual.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3145256	71			0	gl	Se o obxecto está ancorado \<emph\>como carácter\</emph\>, non existirá ningunha icona e non poderá mover o obxecto.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3149527				0	gl	Se o obxecto está ancorado \<emph\>ao marco\</emph\>, as teclas de frecha móveno ao marco seguinte na dirección correspondente.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153270				0	gl	Controlar as liñas divisorias				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3158413	134			0	gl	Os documentos de \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Calc, de \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Draw e de \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Impress pode dividirse horizontal e verticalmente en visualizacións separadas. Cada visualización pode mostrar outras partes do documento. Co rato pode arrastrar unha liña divisoria desde a barra de desprazamento ata o documento.				20200411 15:09:53
