helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	hd_id0526200903595096				0	gl	The following data will be recorded and sent:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595033				0	gl	Clicks on toolbar buttons, including extension toolbars 				20200411 15:09:53
