helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id5781731				0	gl	^ means the match has to be at the start of a paragraph, 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id6942045				0	gl	[:digit:] matches any decimal digit, 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id4721823				0	gl	{3} means there must be exactly 3 copies of "digit", 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id5806756				0	gl	$ means the match must end a paragraph. 				20200411 15:09:53
