helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id4071779				0	gl	The following lists all facets that are valid for data types. Some facets are only available for some data types.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	hd_id4313791				0	gl	Espazos en branco				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id4331797				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies how whitespaces are to be handled when a string of the current data type is being processed. Possible values are Preserve, Replace, and Collapse. The sematics follow the definition at http://www.w3.org/TR/xmlschema-2/#rf-whiteSpace.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	hd_id4191717				0	gl	Patrón				20200411 15:09:53
