helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159300				0	gl	Add non breaking space before specific punctuation marks in French text				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153173				0	gl	Inserts a non breaking space before ";", "!", "?" and ":" when the character language is set to French (France, Belgium, Luxembourg, Monaco, or Switzerland) and before ":" only when the character language is set to French (Canada).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159400				0	gl	Format ordinal number suffixes (1st ... 1^st)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154173				0	gl	Formats the text characters of ordinals, such as 1st, 2nd, or 3rd, as superscripts. For example, in English text, 1st will be converted to 1^st.				20200411 15:09:53
