helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3187353				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The automatic view layout displays pages side by side, as many as the zoom factor allows.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
