helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id1993774				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>In columns view layout you see pages in a given number of columns side by side. Enter the number of columns.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
