helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153882				0	gl	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/06010000.xhp\" name=\"Spellcheck\"\>Spelling and Grammar\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154682				0	gl	\<variable id=\"recht\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Spelling\"\>Checks the document or the current selection for spelling errors. If a grammar checking extension is installed, the dialog also checks for grammar errors.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1064B				0	gl	A verificación ortográfica comeza na posición actual do cursor e avanza ata a fin do documento ou da selección. Tamén existe a posibilidade de continuar a verificación ortográfica a partir do inicio do documento.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3166445				0	gl	Spellcheck looks for misspelled words and gives you the option of adding an unknown word to a user dictionary. When the first misspelled word is found, the \<emph\>Spellcheck\</emph\> dialog opens.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_id1022200801300654				0	gl	If a grammar checking extension is installed, this dialog is called \<emph\>Spelling and Grammar\</emph\>. Spelling errors are underlined in red, grammar errors in blue. First the dialog presents all spelling errors, then all grammar errors.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_id1022200801354366				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Enable \<emph\>Check grammar\</emph\> to work first on all spellcheck errors, then on all grammar errors.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149511				0	gl	Non consta no dicionario				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149798				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Displays the sentence with the misspelled word highlighted. Edit the word or the sentence, or click one of the suggestions in the text box below.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149885				0	gl	Suxestións				20200411 15:09:53
