helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150037				0	gl	The text color is ignored when printing, if the \<emph\>Print black\</emph\> check box is selected in \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040400.xhp\" name=\"Writer - Print\"\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - Print\</emph\>\</link\> in the Options dialog box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020200.xhp	0	help	par_id7613757				0	gl	The text color is ignored on screen, if the \<emph\>Use automatic font color for screen display\</emph\> check box is selected in \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</emph\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Tools - Options\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>\<emph\> - \</emph\>\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01013000.xhp\"\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME - Accessibility\</emph\>\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
