helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155766				0	gl	Campos implicados				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148994				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies two data fields that will be joined by a relation.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
