helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3479720				0	gl	The Adabas D software package can be downloaded and installed separately (see www.adabas.com).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152997				0	gl	Sobre Adabas				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151111				0	gl	The free available Adabas database is restricted to a size of 100 MB, and a maximum of three users on a network. See the "License.txt" file in the Adabas directory for more details. The Adabas database must be installed in a separate directory from $[officename].				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154749				0	gl	Os nomes dos ficheiros Adabas deben ter menos de 8 caracteres. Os camiños, incluíndo o propio nome dos ficheiros, non poden exceder os 30 caracteres e deben ser compatíbeis co código ASCII de 7 bits. Nin camiños nin nomes poden conter espazos.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153254				0	gl	En Windows, o aplicativo de instalación de Adabas engade a variábel de contorno DBROOT, que contén a información do camiño á base de datos. Se o aplicativo de instalación encontra esta variábel, non instala a base de datos.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154729				0	gl	Crear nova base de datos Adabas				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149378				0	gl	Utilice a caixa de diálogo \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/30100000.xhp\" name=\"Crear nova base de datos Adabas\"\>\<emph\>Crear nova base de datos Adabas\</emph\>\</link\> para crer unha base de datos Adabas:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147045				0	gl	Escolla \<emph\>Ficheiro - Novo - Base de datos\</emph\> para abrir o asistente de bases de datos.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147394				0	gl	Prema en \<emph\>Conectar cunha base de datos existente\</emph\> e seleccione "Adabas" (desprácese cara a arriba na lista).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155600				0	gl	Work through the steps in the remaining pages of the Database Wizard.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154270				0	gl	Eliminación de bases de datos Adabas				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3157869				0	gl	Para eliminar a referencia a unha base de datos Adabas, escolla \<emph\>Ferramentas - Opcións - %PRODUCTNAME Base - Bases de datos\</emph\>. Seleccione a base de datos e, a seguir, prema en \<emph\>Eliminar\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
