helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152577				0	gl	This dialog allows you to change the properties of a selected data point. The dialog appears when there is only one data point selected when you choose \<emph\>Format - Format Selection\</emph\>. Some of the menu entries are only available for 2D or 3D charts.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149121				0	gl	Os cambios realizados afectan exclusivamente ao punto de datos en cuestión. Por exemplo, se edita a cor dunha barra, só será diferente a cor desa barra específica.				20200411 15:09:53
