helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\08020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154510				0	gl	This Status bar field uses the same measurement units as the rulers. You can define the units by choosing \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01070500.xhp\" name=\"Presentation - General\"\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME Impress - General\</emph\>\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
