helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10090000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159238				0	gl	\<link href=\"text/simpress/02/10090000.xhp\" name=\"Obxectos 3D\"\>Obxectos 3D\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152900				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Objects3DToolbox\"\>Opens the \<emph\>3D Objects\</emph\> toolbar. The objects are three dimensional, with depth, illumination, and reflection.\</ahelp\> Each inserted object initially forms a 3D scene. You can press F3 to enter the scene. For these 3D objects, you can open the 3D Effects dialog to edit the properties.				20200411 15:09:53
