helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\3d_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN1088B				0	gl	Prema na icona \<emph\>Activar/Desactivar extrusión\</emph\> \<image id=\"img_id2490920\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_extrusiontoggle.png\" width=\"0.1665inch\" height=\"0.1665inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id2490920\"\>Icona\</alt\>\</image\> na barra \<emph\>Debuxo\</emph\> ou prema co botón dereito do rato no obxecto e escolla \<emph\>Converter - En 3D\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
