helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\select_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3159238				0	gl	To select an object that is covered by other objects, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> and click through the objects until you reach the underlying object. To cycle through the objects in reverse order, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift when you click.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\select_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3150213				0	gl	Se quere usar o teclado para seleccionar un obxecto que está cuberto por outro, prema na tecla Tab para percorrer os obxectos da diapositiva. Para percorrer os obxectos en orde inversa, prema en Maiús+Tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_draw.xhp	0	help	tit				0	gl	Debuxar curvas				20200411 15:09:53
