helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3153080	63			0	gl	Na barra \<emph\>Editar puntos\</emph\>, prema na icona \<emph\>Pechar Bézier\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
