helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145584	14			0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"IMPRESS\"\>Includes objects on the slide master in the new slide. \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Includes objects on the master page in the new page.\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
