helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\userdefined_function.xhp	0	help	par_id3150043				0	gl	A súa función gárdase automaticamente no módulo predefinido e xa está dispoñíbel. Se aplica a función nalgún documento de Calc, para que se poida usar noutro computador, copie a función no documento de Calc da maneira descrita na seguinte sección.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\userdefined_function.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147340				0	gl	Copiar unha función nun documento				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\userdefined_function.xhp	0	help	par_id3145232	19			0	gl	Na etapa 2 de "Definir funcións con %PRODUCTNAME Basic", na caixa de diálogo \<emph\>Macro\</emph\>, premeu en \<emph\>Editar\</emph\>. Como opción predefinida, no campo \<emph\>Macro de\</emph\>, selecciónase o módulo \<emph\>As miñas macros - Estándar - Módulo1\</emph\>. A biblioteca \<emph\>Estándar\</emph\> encóntrase localmente no seu cartafol de usuario.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\userdefined_function.xhp	0	help	par_id3154022				0	gl	Para copiar a función definida polo usuario nun documento de Calc:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\userdefined_function.xhp	0	help	par_id3150304				0	gl	Escolla \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Ferramentas - Macros - Organizar macros - %PRODUCTNAME Basic\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\userdefined_function.xhp	0	help	par_id3150086				0	gl	No campo \<emph\>Macro de\</emph\>, seleccione \<emph\>As miñas macros - Estándar - Módulo1\</emph\> e prema en \<emph\>Editar\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\userdefined_function.xhp	0	help	par_id3166430				0	gl	No IDE de Basic, seleccione a fonte da súa función definida polo usuario e cópiea no portapapeis.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\userdefined_function.xhp	0	help	par_idN1081D				0	gl	Peche o IDE de Basic.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\userdefined_function.xhp	0	help	par_id3150517				0	gl	Escolla \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Ferramentas - Macros - Organizar macros - %PRODUCTNAME Basic\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\userdefined_function.xhp	0	help	par_id3145384				0	gl	No campo \<emph\>Macro de\</emph\>, seleccione \<emph\>(Nome do documento de Calc) - Estándar - Módulo1\</emph\>. Prema en \<emph\>Editar\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\userdefined_function.xhp	0	help	par_id3148699				0	gl	Pegue o contido do portapapeis no IDE de Basic do documento.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\userdefined_function.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153305				0	gl	Aplicar as funcións definidas polo usuario en $[officename] Calc				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\userdefined_function.xhp	0	help	par_id3148869				0	gl	Despois de definir unha función \<item type=\"literal\"\>VOL(a; b; c)\</item\> no IDE de Basic, pode aplicala da mesma maneira que as funcións de $[officename] Calc.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\userdefined_function.xhp	0	help	par_id3148606				0	gl	Abra un documento de Calc e introduza números para os parámetros de función \<item type=\"literal\"\>a\</item\>, \<item type=\"literal\"\>b\</item\> e \<item type=\"literal\"\>c\</item\> nas celas A1, B1 e C1.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\userdefined_function.xhp	0	help	par_id3156019				0	gl	Coloque o cursor noutra cela e introduza o seguinte:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\userdefined_function.xhp	0	help	par_id3155264				0	gl	=VOL(A1;B1;C1)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\userdefined_function.xhp	0	help	par_id3146776				0	gl	A función avalíase e pode ver o resultado na cela seleccionada.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_formula.xhp	0	help	tit				0	gl	Importar e exportar ficheiros de texto				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_formula.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153726				0	gl	\<bookmark_value\>csv files;formulas\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>formulas; importing/exporting as csv files\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>exporting;formulas as csv files\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>importing;csv files with formulas\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_formula.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153726				0	gl	\<variable id=\"csv_formula\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/csv_formula.xhp\" name=\"Importing and Exporting Text Files\"\>Importing and Exporting CSV Text Files with Formulas\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3149402				0	gl	Os ficheiros de valores separados por comas (CSV) son ficheiros de texto que conteñen os contidos da cela nunha única folla de cálculo. Poden usarse as comas, os punto e comas, e outros caracteres como delimitadores de campo entre as celas. As cadeas de texto colócanse entre comiñas, mais os números non.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_formula.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150715				0	gl	To Import a CSV File				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3153709				0	gl	Escolla \<emph\>Ficheiro - Abrir\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3155445				0	gl	No campo \<emph\>Tipo de ficheiro\</emph\>, seleccione o formato "Texto CSV". Seleccione o ficheiro e prema en \<emph\>Abrir\</emph\>. Cando os ficheiros teñen a extensión .csv, o tipo de ficheiro recoñécese automaticamente.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3149565				0	gl	You will see the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Text Import\</item\> dialog. Click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>OK\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3149255				0	gl	If the csv file contains formulas, but you want to import the results of those formulas, then choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Calc - View\</emph\> and clear the \<emph\>Formulas\</emph\> check box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_formula.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154022				0	gl	To Export Formulas and Values as CSV Files				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3150342				0	gl	Prema na folla que desexa gravar como ficheiro csv.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3166423				0	gl	Para exportar as fórmulas como fórmulas, por exemplo, no formato =SUMA(A1:B5), proceda da seguinte maneira:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3155111				0	gl	Choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Calc - View\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3150200				0	gl	En \<emph\>Mostrar\</emph\>, marque a caixa de verificación \<emph\>Fórmulas\</emph\>. Prema en \<emph\>Aceptar\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3154484				0	gl	Para exportar os resultados do cálculo en vez das fórmulas, non marque \<emph\>Fórmulas\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3148702				0	gl	Escolla \<emph\>Ficheiro - Gardar como\</emph\>. Verá a caixa de diálogo \<emph\>Gardar como\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3153912				0	gl	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>File type\</item\> field select the format "Text CSV".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3157978				0	gl	Introduza un nome e prema en \<emph\>Gardar\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3152869				0	gl	Na caixa de diálogo \<emph\>Exportar ficheiros de texto\</emph\>, seleccione o conxunto de caracteres e os delimitadores de texto e de campo para os datos que van ser exportados, e confirme con \<emph\>Aceptar\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3146781				0	gl	If the numbers use commas as decimal separators or thousands separators, do not select the comma as the field delimiter. If the text contains double quotation marks, you must select the single quotation mark as separator.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3150050				0	gl	Se é necesario, despois de gardar, desmarque a caixa de verificación \<emph\>Fórmulas\</emph\> para ver os resultados do cálculo novamente na táboa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3153487				0	gl	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01060100.xhp\" name=\"Spreadsheet - View\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Calc - View\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3153008				0	gl	\<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000207.xhp\" name=\"Exportar ficheiros de texto\"\>Exportar ficheiros de texto\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3155595				0	gl	\<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000208.xhp\" name=\"Importar ficheiros de texto\"\>Importar de ficheiros de texto\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\super_subscript.xhp	0	help	tit				0	gl	Superíndice / Subíndice				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\super_subscript.xhp	0	help	bm_id3151112				0	gl	\<bookmark_value\>texto superíndice en celas\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>texto subíndice en celas\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>celas; superíndice/subíndice\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\super_subscript.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151112				0	gl	\<variable id=\"super_subscript\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/super_subscript.xhp\" name=\"Superíndice/ Subíndice\"\>Superíndice / Subíndice\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\super_subscript.xhp	0	help	par_id3154684				0	gl	Na cela, seleccione o carácter que desexa colocar como superíndice ou subíndice.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\super_subscript.xhp	0	help	par_id3150439				0	gl	Se, por exemplo, quere escribir H20 co 2 como subíndice, seleccione o 2 na cela (non na liña de entrada).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\super_subscript.xhp	0	help	par_id3149260				0	gl	Abra o menú de contexto correspondente ao carácter seleccionado e escolla \<emph\>Carácter\</emph\>. Aparece a caixa de diálogo \<emph\>Carácter\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\super_subscript.xhp	0	help	par_id3153142				0	gl	Prema no separador \<emph\>Posición do tipo de letra\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\super_subscript.xhp	0	help	par_id3153954				0	gl	Seleccione a opción \<emph\>Subíndice\</emph\> e prema en Aceptar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\super_subscript.xhp	0	help	par_id3153876				0	gl	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05020500.xhp\" name=\"Menú de contexto - Carácter - Posición do tipo de letra\"\>Menú de contexto - Carácter - Posición do tipo de letra\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	tit				0	gl	Calcular series automaticamente				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150769				0	gl	\<bookmark_value\>series; calculating\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>calculating; series\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>linear series\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>growth series\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>date series\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>powers of 2 calculations\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>cells; filling automatically\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>automatic cell filling\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>AutoFill function\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>filling;cells, automatically\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150769				0	gl	\<variable id=\"calc_series\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/calc_series.xhp\" name=\"Calcular series automaticamente\"\>Enchemento automático de datos tomando como base as celas adxacentes\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_idN106A8				0	gl	Use as ordes Enchemento automático ou Serie para encher as celas de forma automática.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D3				0	gl	Utilizar o Enchemento automático.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D7				0	gl	Enchemento automático xera series de datos en base a patróns predefinidos.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_id3154319				0	gl	On a sheet, click in a cell, and type a number.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_idN106CB				0	gl	Prema noutra cela e despois prema novamente na cela en que introduciu o número.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_id3145272				0	gl	Arrastre o controlador de enchemento, situado no canto inferior dereito da cela, a través das celas que quere encher, e solte despois o botón do rato.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_id3145801				0	gl	As celas énchense de números en lista ascendente.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_idN106EE				0	gl	To quickly create a list of consecutive days, enter \<item type=\"literal\"\>Monday\</item\> in a cell, and drag the fill handle.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_id9720145				0	gl	Hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl \</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>if you do not want to fill the cells with different values.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_id3154490				0	gl	If you select two or more adjacent cells that contain different numbers, and drag, the remaining cells are filled with the arithmetic pattern that is recognized in the numbers. The AutoFill function also recognizes customized lists that are defined under \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Calc - Sort Lists\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_idN10737				0	gl	Pode premer dúas veces no controlador de enchemento para encher todas as columnas baleiras do bloque de datos activo. Por exemplo, introduza primeiro xan en A1 e arrastre o controlador de enchemento cara a abaixo ata A12 para ter os doce meses na primeira columna. A seguir, introduza algúns valores en B1 e C1. Seleccione as dúas celas e prema dúas veces no controlador de enchemento. O bloque de datos B1:C12 encherase automaticamente.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_idN10713				0	gl	Utilizar series definidas				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_id3150749				0	gl	Seleccione na folla de cálculo o intervalo de celas que desexa encher.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_id3154754				0	gl	Escolla \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Editar - Encher - Series\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_idN10716				0	gl	Seleccione os parámetros para a serie.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_idN10731				0	gl	Se selecciona unha serie \<emph\>aritmética\</emph\>, o incremento introducido \<emph\>engádese\</emph\> a cada número consecutivo da serie para crear o valor seguinte.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_idN1073C				0	gl	Se selecciona unha serie \<emph\>xeométrica\</emph\>, o incremento inserido \<emph\>multiplícase\</emph\> por cada número consecutivo para crear o valor seguinte.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_idN10747				0	gl	Se selecciona unha serie de \<emph\>data\</emph\>, o incremento introducido engádese á unidade de tempo que especifique.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_id3159173				0	gl	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01060400.xhp\" name=\"Listas de ordenación\"\>Listas de ordenación\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	tit				0	gl	Creating Pivot Tables				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148491				0	gl	\<bookmark_value\>pivot tables\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>pivot table function; calling up and applying\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148491				0	gl	\<variable id=\"datapilot_createtable\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/datapilot_createtable.xhp\" name=\"Creating Pivot Tables\"\>Creating Pivot Tables\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	par_id3156023				0	gl	Coloque o cursor nun intervalo de celas que conteña valores e cabeceiras de filas e de columnas.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	par_id3147264				0	gl	Choose \<emph\>Data - Pivot Table - Create\</emph\>. The \<emph\>Select Source\</emph\> dialog appears. Choose \<emph\>Current selection\</emph\> and confirm with \<emph\>OK\</emph\>. The table headings are shown as buttons in the \<emph\>Pivot Table\</emph\> dialog. Drag these buttons as required and drop them into the layout areas "Page Fields", "Column Fields", "Row Fields" and "Data Fields".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	par_id3150868				0	gl	Agora pode escoller botóns e arrastralos ata unha das catro áreas.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	par_id7599414				0	gl	Drag a button to the \<emph\>Page Fields\</emph\> area to create a button and a listbox on top of the generated pivot table. The listbox can be used to filter the pivot table by the contents of the selected item. You can use drag-and-drop within the generated pivot table to use another page field as a filter.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	par_id3154011				0	gl	Se solta o botón na área \<emph\>Campos de datos\</emph\>, a área recibe unha lenda cunha fórmula que será usada para calcular os datos.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	par_id3146974				0	gl	Se preme dúas veces nun dos campos da área \<emph\>Campos de datos\</emph\>, poderá activar a caixa de diálogo \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/12090105.xhp\" name=\"Campo de datos\"\>\<emph\>Campo de datos\</emph\>\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	par_id3156286				0	gl	Use the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Data Field\</item\> dialog to select the calculations to be used for the data. To make a multiple selection, press the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl \</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>key while clicking the desired calculation.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	par_id3150329				0	gl	A orde dos botóns pode modificarse en calquera momento, movéndoos co rato ata unha posición diferente da mesma área.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	par_id3153714				0	gl	Elimine o botón arrastrándoo de volta a área en que se encontran os outros botóns, na parte dereita da caixa de diálogo.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	par_id3147338				0	gl	Para abrir a caixa de diálogo \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/12090105.xhp\" name=\"Campo de datos\"\>\<emph\>Campo de datos\</emph\>\</link\>, prema dúas veces nun dos botóns da área \<emph\>Fila\</emph\> ou \<emph\>Columna\</emph\>. Na caixa de diálogo pode seleccionar que \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> calcule ou non os subtotais, ou que o faga nunha certa medida.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	par_id3154020				0	gl	Exit the Pivot Table dialog by pressing OK. A \<emph\>Filter\</emph\> button will now be inserted, or a page button for every data field that you dropped in the \<emph\>Page Fields\</emph\> area. The pivot table is inserted further down.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_details.xhp	0	help	tit				0	gl	Imprimir detalles de folla				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_details.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154346				0	gl	\<bookmark_value\>printing;sheet details\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>sheets; printing details\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>grids; printing sheet grids\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>formulas; printing, instead of results\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>comments; printing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>charts;printing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>sheet grids; printing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>cells; printing grids\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>borders; printing cells\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>zero values; printing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>null values; printing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>draw objects;printing\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_details.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154346				0	gl	\<variable id=\"print_details\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/print_details.xhp\" name=\"Imprimir detalles de folla\"\>Imprimir detalles de folla\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_details.xhp	0	help	par_id3153728				0	gl	Ao imprimir unha folla, pode seleccionar os detalles que se van imprimir:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_details.xhp	0	help	par_id3150010				0	gl	Cabeceiras de fila e columna				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_details.xhp	0	help	par_id3154013				0	gl	Grade de folla				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_details.xhp	0	help	par_id3145273				0	gl	Comentarios				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_details.xhp	0	help	par_id3145801				0	gl	Obxectos e imaxes				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_details.xhp	0	help	par_id3154491				0	gl	Gráficas				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_details.xhp	0	help	par_id3154731				0	gl	Obxectos de debuxo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_details.xhp	0	help	par_id3149400				0	gl	Fórmulas				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_details.xhp	0	help	par_id3150752				0	gl	Para escoller os detalles, proceda da seguinte maneira:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_details.xhp	0	help	par_id3145640				0	gl	Seleccione a folla que vai imprimir.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_details.xhp	0	help	par_id3150042				0	gl	Escolla \<emph\>Formato - Páxina\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_details.xhp	0	help	par_id3147340	13			0	gl	A orde non é visíbel cando a folla se abre co sistema de protección contra escrita activo. Nese caso, prema na icona \<emph\>Editar ficheiro \</emph\>na barra de ferramentas \<emph\>Estándar\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_details.xhp	0	help	par_id3146916	14			0	gl	Seleccione o separador \<emph\>Folla\</emph\>. Na área \<emph\>Imprimir\</emph\>, marque os detalles que desexa imprimir e prema en Aceptar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_details.xhp	0	help	par_id3145789				0	gl	Imprima o documento.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_details.xhp	0	help	par_id3150345				0	gl	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/03100000.xhp\" name=\"Ver - Previsualización de quebra de páxina\"\>Ver - Previsualización de quebra de páxina\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_date.xhp	0	help	tit				0	gl	Calcular con datas e horas				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_date.xhp	0	help	bm_id3146120				0	gl	\<bookmark_value\>dates; in cells\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>times; in cells\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>cells;date and time formats\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>current date and time values\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_date.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146120				0	gl	\<variable id=\"calc_date\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/calc_date.xhp\" name=\"Calcular con datas e horas\"\>Calcular con datas e horas\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3154320				0	gl	En $[officename] Calc pode efectuar cálculos con datas e horas actuais, obtidas do reloxo interno do sistema. Por exemplo, para averiguar a súa idade exacta, en segundos ou horas, siga os pasos seguintes:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3150750				0	gl	Introduza a data do seu nacemento na cela A1 dunha folla de cálculo.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3145642	14			0	gl	Enter the following formula in cell A3: \<item type=\"literal\"\>=NOW()-A1\</item\>            				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3149020				0	gl	Tras premer a tecla Intro, pode ver o resultado en formato de data. Formate a cela A3 en forma de número, xa que o resultado ten que reflectir a diferenza entre dúas data en forma de número de días.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3155335				0	gl	Coloque o cursor na cela A3, prema co botón dereito do rato para abrir un menú de contexto, e escolla \<emph\>Formatar celas\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3147343				0	gl	The \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format Cells\</item\> dialog appears. On the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Numbers\</item\> tab, the "Number" category will appear already highlighted. The format is set to "General", which causes the result of a calculation containing date entries to be displayed as a date. To display the result as a number, set the number format to "-1,234" and close the dialog with the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>OK\</item\> button.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3147001				0	gl	O número de días entre a data de hoxe e a data especificada móstrase na cela A3.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3150304				0	gl	Probe con algunhas fórmulas adicionais: Introduza =A3*24 en A4 para calcular as horas; A4*60 en A5 para os minutos e A5*60 en A6 para os segundos. Prema na tecla \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Intro\</item\> despois de cada fórmula.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3149207				0	gl	Calcúlase o tempo transcorrido desde a súa data de nacemento e visualízase nas distintas unidades. Os valores calcúlanse a partir do momento exacto en que introduciu a última fórmula e premeu na tecla \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Intro\</item\>. O valor non se actualiza de maneira automática, aínda que "Agora" cambie continuamente. No menú \<emph\>Ferramentas\</emph\>, a opción do menú \<emph\>Contido de cela - Calcular automaticamente\</emph\> adoita estar activo; porén, o cálculo automático non se aplica á función AGORA, evitando así que o seu ordenador estea ocupado exclusivamente en actualizar a folla de cálculo.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\text_wrap.xhp	0	help	tit				0	gl	Escribir texto multiliña				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\text_wrap.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154346				0	gl	\<bookmark_value\>texto en celas; multiliña\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>celas; quebras de texto\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>quebras en celas\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>texto multiliña en celas\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\text_wrap.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154346				0	gl	\<variable id=\"text_wrap\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/text_wrap.xhp\" name=\"Escribir texto multiliña\"\>Escribir texto multiliña\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\text_wrap.xhp	0	help	par_id3156280				0	gl	Pressing the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Enter keys inserts a manual line break. This shortcut only works directly in the cell, not in the input line.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\text_wrap.xhp	0	help	par_id3153142				0	gl	Para que o texto teña un axuste automático no bordo da cela, faga o seguinte:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\text_wrap.xhp	0	help	par_id3153951				0	gl	Seleccione as celas en cuxo bordo dereito quere introducir un axuste automático de texto.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\text_wrap.xhp	0	help	par_id3148575				0	gl	In \<emph\>Format - Cells - Alignment\</emph\>, mark the \<emph\>Wrap text automatically\</emph\> option and click OK.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\text_wrap.xhp	0	help	par_id3145799				0	gl	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/05020000.xhp\" name=\"Formato - Celas\"\>Formato - Celas\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_copy.xhp	0	help	tit				0	gl	Copiar fórmulas				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_copy.xhp	0	help	bm_id3151113				0	gl	\<bookmark_value\>fórmulas; copiar e pegar\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>copiar; fórmulas\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>pegar;fórmulas\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_copy.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151113				0	gl	\<variable id=\"formula_copy\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/formula_copy.xhp\" name=\"Copiar fórmulas\"\>Copiar fórmulas\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_copy.xhp	0	help	par_id3156424				0	gl	Hai varias maneiras de copiar as fórmulas. Pode usarse, por exemplo, o seguinte método:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_copy.xhp	0	help	par_id3150439				0	gl	Select the cell containing the formula.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_copy.xhp	0	help	par_id3154319				0	gl	Escolla \<emph\>Editar - Pegar\</emph\> ou prema \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Comando\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+V. A fórmula colocarase na nova cela.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_copy.xhp	0	help	par_id3159155				0	gl	Seleccione a cela en que desexa copiar a fórmula.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_copy.xhp	0	help	par_id3153728				0	gl	Escolla \<emph\>Editar - Pegar\</emph\> ou prema \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Comando\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+V. A fórmula colocarase na nova cela.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_copy.xhp	0	help	par_id3149961				0	gl	Se quere copiar a fórmula en varias celas, hai unha maneira rápida e fácil de copiala en áreas de cela adxacentes:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_copy.xhp	0	help	par_id3149400				0	gl	Select the cell containing the formula.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_copy.xhp	0	help	par_id3154018				0	gl	Coloque o rato no canto inferior dereito do bordo realzado da cela e non deixe de premer o botón do rato ata que o apuntador se transforme nun símbolo en forma de cruz.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_copy.xhp	0	help	par_id3150749				0	gl	Sen soltar o botón do rato, arrástreo cara a abaixo ou cara á dereita sobre todas as celas en que quere copiar a fórmula.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_copy.xhp	0	help	par_id3153714				0	gl	Ao soltar o botón do rato, a fórmula cópiase nas celas e axústase automaticamente.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_copy.xhp	0	help	par_id3156385				0	gl	Se non quere que se axusten automaticamente os valores e os textos, prema na tecla \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Comando\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> ao arrastrar. As fórmulas, no entanto, axústanse sempre.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\filters.xhp	0	help	tit				0	gl	Aplicar filtros				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\filters.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153896				0	gl	\<bookmark_value\>filters; applying/removing\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>rows;removing/redisplaying with filters\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>removing;filters\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\filters.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153896				0	gl	\<variable id=\"filters\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/filters.xhp\" name=\"Aplicar filtros\"\>Aplicar filtros\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\filters.xhp	0	help	par_id3150869				0	gl	Os filtros e os filtros avanzados permiten traballar con certas filas filtradas (rexistros) dun intervalo de datos. Nas follas de cálculo de $[officename] existen varias posibilidades para aplicar filtros.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\filters.xhp	0	help	par_id3155131				0	gl	Un posíbel uso da función \<emph\>Filtro automático\</emph\> é a de restrinxir rapidamente a visualización a rexistros con entradas idénticas no campo de datos.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\filters.xhp	0	help	par_id3146119				0	gl	In the \<emph\>Standard Filter\</emph\> dialog, you can also define ranges which contain the values in particular data fields. You can use the standard filter to connect the conditions with either a logical AND or a logical OR operator.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\filters.xhp	0	help	par_id3150010				0	gl	The \<emph\>Advanced filter\</emph\> allows up to a total of eight filter conditions. With advanced filters you enter the conditions directly into the sheet.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\filters.xhp	0	help	par_id9384746				0	gl	To remove a filter, so that you see all cells again, click inside the area where the filter was applied, then choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Data - Filter - Remove Filter\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\filters.xhp	0	help	par_idN10663				0	gl	When you select multiple rows from an area where a filter was applied, then this selection can include rows that are visible and rows that are hidden by the filter. If you then apply formatting, or delete the selected rows, this action then applies only to the visible rows. The hidden rows are not affected. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\filters.xhp	0	help	par_id218817				0	gl	This is the opposite to rows that you have hidden manually by the \<emph\>Format - Rows - Hide Rows\</emph\> command. Manually hidden rows are deleted when you delete a selection that contains them.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\text_numbers.xhp	0	help	tit				0	gl	Formatar números como texto				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\text_numbers.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145068				0	gl	\<bookmark_value\>numbers;entering as text\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>text formats; for numbers\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>formats; numbers as text\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>cell formats; text/numbers\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>formatting;numbers as text\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\text_numbers.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145068				0	gl	\<variable id=\"text_numbers\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/text_numbers.xhp\" name=\"Formatar números como texto\"\>Formatar números como texto\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\text_numbers.xhp	0	help	par_id3156280				0	gl	Pode formatar números como texto en $[officename] Calc. Abra o menú de contexto dunha cela ou intervalo de celas e escolla \<emph\>Formatar celas - Números\</emph\>, e seleccione "Texto" na lista \<emph\>Categoría\</emph\>. Todos os números que se introduzan despois no intervalo formatado interpretaranse como texto. A visualización deses "números" xustifícase á esquerda, como calquera outro texto.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\text_numbers.xhp	0	help	par_id3149377				0	gl	Se xa introduciu números normais nas celas e modificou o formato das celas a "Texto", os números continuarán a ser números normais e non se modificarán. Só os números introducidos despois, ou os que van editarse, convértense a formato texto.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\text_numbers.xhp	0	help	par_id3144765				0	gl	Se decide introducir algún número directamente como texto, escriba antes un apóstrofo ('). Por exemplo, para colocar anos como títulos de columnas, pode introducir '1999, '2000 e '2001. O apóstrofo non é visíbel na cela, indicando simplemente que a entrada ten que recoñecerse como texto. Isto será útil cando introduza números de teléfono ou códigos postais que comecen por (0), pois os formatos de números normais eliminan os ceros (0) que preceden ás secuencias de números.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\text_numbers.xhp	0	help	par_id3156284				0	gl	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05020300.xhp\" name=\"Format - Cells - Numbers\"\>Format - Cells - Numbers\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_enter.xhp	0	help	tit				0	gl	Entering Formulas 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_enter.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150868				0	gl	\<bookmark_value\>barra de fórmulas; liña de entrada\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>liña de entrada da barra de fórmulas\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>fórmulas; entrada\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>inserir;fórmulas\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_enter.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150868				0	gl	\<variable id=\"formula_enter\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/formula_enter.xhp\" name=\"Entering Formulas\"\>Entering Formulas\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id6848353				0	gl	You can enter formulas in several ways: using the icons, or by typing on the keyboard, or by a mixture of both methods.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3145364				0	gl	Prema na cela en que quere introducir a fórmula.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3150012				0	gl	Prema na icona \<emph\>Función\</emph\> da barra de fórmulas.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3156441				0	gl	Aparece un sinal igual na liña de entrada. Pode comezar a introducir a fórmula.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3153726				0	gl	Despois de introducir os valores requeridos, prema en Intro ou prema en \<emph\>Aceptar\</emph\> para inserir o resultado na cela activa. Para limpar a entrada na liña de entrada, prema en Esc ou en \<emph\>Cancelar\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3147394				0	gl	Tamén pode introducir os valores e as fórmulas directamente nas celas, mesmo se non pode ver o cursor de entrada. As fórmulas deben sempre comezar por sinais igual.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id4206976				0	gl	You can also press the + or - key on the numerical keyboard to start a formula. NumLock must be "on". For example, press the following keys in succession:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id1836909				0	gl	+ 5 0 - 8 Enter				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id8171330				0	gl	You see the result \<item type=\"literal\"\>42\</item\> in the cell. The cell contains the formula \<item type=\"literal\"\>=+50-8\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3155764				0	gl	If you are editing a formula with references, the references and the associated cells will be highlighted with the same color. You can now resize the reference border using the mouse, and the reference in the formula displayed in the input line also changes. \<emph\>Show references in color\</emph\> can be deactivated under \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01060300.xhp\" name=\"Spreadsheet - View\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Calc - View\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3149210	7			0	gl	\<variable id=\"tip\"\>Se quere ver o cálculo dos elementos individuais dunha fórmula, seleccione os respectivos elementos e prema en F9. Por exemplo, na fórmula =SUMA(A1:B12)*SUMA(C1:D12), seleccione a sección SUMA(C1:D12) e prema en F9 para ver o subtotal da área.\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3150304				0	gl	Se se produce algún erro ao crear a fórmula, aparece unha \<link href=\"text/scalc/05/02140000.xhp\" name=\"mensaxe de erro\"\>mensaxe de erro\</link\> na cela activa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3152993				0	gl	\<link href=\"text/scalc/main0206.xhp\" name=\"Barra de fórmulas\"\>Barra de fórmulas\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\address_auto.xhp	0	help	tit				0	gl	Direccionamento de nomes				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\address_auto.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148797				0	gl	\<bookmark_value\>automatic addressing in tables\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>natural language addressing\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>formulas; using row/column labels\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>text in cells; as addressing\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>addressing; automatic\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>name recognition on/off\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>row headers;using in formulas\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>column headers;using in formulas\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>columns; finding labels automatically\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>rows; finding labels automatically\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>recognizing; column and row labels\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\address_auto.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148797				0	gl	\<variable id=\"address_auto\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/address_auto.xhp\" name=\"Direccionamento de nomes\"\>Direccionamento de nomes\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\address_auto.xhp	0	help	par_id3152597				0	gl	Pode usar as celas con texto para facer referencia ás filas ou ás columnas que as conteñen.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\address_auto.xhp	0	help	par_id3156283				0	gl	\<image id=\"img_id3154942\" src=\"res/helpimg/names_as_addressing.png\" width=\"2.1291in\" height=\"0.8709in\" localize=\"true\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154942\"\>Example spreadsheet\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\address_auto.xhp	0	help	par_id3154512				0	gl	Na folla de cálculo de exemplo, pode usar a cadea de caracteres \<item type=\"literal\"\>'Columna Un'\</item\> nunha fórmula, para facer referencia ao intervalo de celas de \<item type=\"literal\"\>B3\</item\> a \<item type=\"literal\"\>B5\</item\>, ou \<item type=\"literal\"\>'Columna Dous'\</item\> para o intervalo de celas de \<item type=\"literal\"\>C2\</item\> a \<item type=\"literal\"\>C5\</item\>. Tamén pode usar \<item type=\"literal\"\>'Fila Un'\</item\> para o intervalo de celas de \<item type=\"literal\"\>B3\</item\> a \<item type=\"literal\"\>D3\</item\>, ou \<item type=\"literal\"\>'Fila Dous'\</item\> co intervalo de celas de \<item type=\"literal\"\>B4\</item\> a \<item type=\"literal\"\>D4\</item\>. O resultado dunha fórmula con nome de cela, por exemplo, \<item type=\"literal\"\>SUMA('Columna Un')\</item\>, é 600.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\address_auto.xhp	0	help	par_id3155443				0	gl	This function is active by default. To turn this function off, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Calc - Calculate\</emph\> and clear the \<emph\>Automatically find column and row labels\</emph\> check box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\address_auto.xhp	0	help	par_id3149210				0	gl	Calc so recoñece automaticamente os nomes que comezan pola letra "e" e están compostos de caracteres alfanuméricos. Se introduce o nome na fórmula, colóqueo entre comiñas simples ('). Se aparece unha comiña simple nun nome, introduza unha barra invertida diante desa comiña, por exemplo, \<item type=\"literal\"\>'Bar O\\'Carro'.\</item\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\currency_format.xhp	0	help	tit				0	gl	Celas en formato monetario				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\currency_format.xhp	0	help	bm_id3156329				0	gl	\<bookmark_value\>formatos monetarios; follas de cálculo\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>celas; formatos monetarios\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>formatos monetarios internacionais\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>formatos; formatos monetarios en celas\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>moedas; moedas predefinidas\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>predefinidos;formatos monetarios\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>modificar;formatos monetarios\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\currency_format.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156329				0	gl	\<variable id=\"currency_format\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/currency_format.xhp\" name=\"Celas en formato monetario\"\>Celas en formato monetario\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\currency_format.xhp	0	help	par_id3153968				0	gl	In \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Calc you can give numbers any currency format. When you click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Currency\</item\> icon \<image id=\"img_id3150791\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_currencyfield.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3150791\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Formatting\</item\> bar to format a number, the cell is given the default currency format set under \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Language Settings - Languages\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\currency_format.xhp	0	help	par_id3150010				0	gl	O intercambio de documentos de \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Calc poderá levar a equívocos, se outro usuario carga o documento de \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Calc usando un formato monetario diferente.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\currency_format.xhp	0	help	par_id3156442				0	gl	En \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Calc pode estabelecer que un número formatado como "1,234.50 €" se manteña en euros noutro país sen mudar para dólares.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\currency_format.xhp	0	help	par_id3151075				0	gl	You can change the currency format in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format Cells\</item\> dialog (choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Cells - Numbers\</item\> tab) by two country settings. In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Language\</item\> combo box select the basic setting for decimal and thousands separators. In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format\</item\> list box you can select the currency symbol and its position.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\currency_format.xhp	0	help	par_id3150749				0	gl	For example, if the language is set to "Default" and you are using a german locale setting, the currency format will be "1.234,00 €". A point is used before the thousand digits and a comma before the decimal places. If you now select the subordinate currency format "$ English (US)" from the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format\</item\> list box , you will get the following format: "$ 1.234,00". As you can see, the separators have remained the same. Only the currency symbol has been changed and converted, but the underlying format of the notation remains the same as in the locale setting.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\currency_format.xhp	0	help	par_id3145640				0	gl	If, under \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Language\</item\>, you convert the cells to "English (US)", the English-language locale setting is also transferred and the default currency format is now "$ 1,234.00".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\currency_format.xhp	0	help	par_id3154255				0	gl	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05020300.xhp\" name=\"Format - Cells - Numbers\"\>Format - Cells - Numbers\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_enter.xhp	0	help	tit				0	gl	Entering Values				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_enter.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150868				0	gl	\<bookmark_value\>values; inserting in multiple cells\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>inserting;values\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>cell ranges;selecting for data entries\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>areas, see also cell ranges\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_enter.xhp	0	help	hd_id3405255				0	gl	\<variable id=\"cell_enter\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/cell_enter.xhp\"\>Entering Values\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id7147129				0	gl	Calc can simplify entering data and values into multiple cells. You can change some settings to conform to your preferences.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_enter.xhp	0	help	hd_id5621509				0	gl	To Enter Values Into a Range of Cells Manually				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id8200018				0	gl	There are two features that assist you when you enter a block of data manually.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_enter.xhp	0	help	hd_id1867427				0	gl	Area Detection for New Rows				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id7908871				0	gl	In the row below a heading row, you can advance from one cell to the next with the Tab key. After you enter the value into the last cell in the current row, press Enter. Calc positions the cursor below the first cell of the current block.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id6196783				0	gl	\<image id=\"img_id6473586\" src=\"res/helpimg/area1.png\" width=\"4.8335in\" height=\"1.5937in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id6473586\"\>area detection\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id8118839				0	gl	In row 3, press Tab to advance from cell B3 to C3, D3, and E3. Then press Enter to advance to B4.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_enter.xhp	0	help	hd_id3583788				0	gl	Area Selection				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id2011780				0	gl	Use drag-and-drop to select the area where you want to input values. But start dragging from the last cell of the area and release the mouse button when you have selected the first cell. Now you can start to input values. Always press the Tab key to advance to the next cell. You will not leave the selected area.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id7044282				0	gl	\<image id=\"img_id2811365\" src=\"res/helpimg/area2.png\" width=\"4.8335in\" height=\"1.5937in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id2811365\"\>area selection\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3232520				0	gl	Select the area from E7 to B3. Now B3 is waiting for your input. Press Tab to advance to the next cell within the selected area.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_enter.xhp	0	help	hd_id8950163				0	gl	To Enter Values to a Range of Cells Automatically				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id633869				0	gl	See \<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/calc_series.xhp\"\>Automatically Filling in Data Based on Adjacent Cells\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_timevalues.xhp	0	help	tit				0	gl	Calcular diferenzas de hora				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_timevalues.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150769				0	gl	\<bookmark_value\>calcular;diferenzas de hora\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>diferenzas de hora\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_timevalues.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150769				0	gl	\<variable id=\"calc_timevalues\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/calc_timevalues.xhp\" name=\"Calcular diferenzas de hora\"\>Calcular diferenzas de hora.\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_timevalues.xhp	0	help	par_id3149263				0	gl	Para calcular as diferenzas de hora, por exemplo, entre as 23:30 e a 01:10 da mesma noite, use a fórmula seguinte:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_timevalues.xhp	0	help	par_id3159153				0	gl	=(B2<A2)+B2-A2				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_timevalues.xhp	0	help	par_id3152598				0	gl	A última hora é B2 e a hora anterior é A2. O resultado do exemplo é 01:40 ou 1 hora e 40 minutos.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_timevalues.xhp	0	help	par_id3145271				0	gl	Na fórmula, un día enteiro de 24 horas ten o valor 1, e unha hora o valor 1/24. O valor lóxico entre parénteses é 0 ou 1, correspondendo a 0 ou 24 horas. A fórmula devolve automaticamente un resultado en formato tempo, debido á secuencia dos operandos.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\main.xhp	0	help	tit				0	gl	Instrucións para utilizar $[officename] Calc				20200411 15:09:53
