helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN107AF				0	gl	Soamente se poderá exportar a folla de cálculo aberta.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN10905				0	gl	Escolla \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Ficheiro - Novo - Base de datos\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN10915				0	gl	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>File name\</item\> box, enter a name for the file.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN1090D				0	gl	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>File type\</item\> box, select "Text CSV".				20200411 15:09:53
