helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\table_rotate.xhp	0	help	par_id3144764				0	gl	Na caixa de diálogo, marque \<emph\>Pegar todo\</emph\> e \<emph\>Traspor\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\table_rotate.xhp	0	help	par_id3155600				0	gl	Se preme agora en Aceptar, trasporanse as columnas e as filas.				20200411 15:09:53
