helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3149401				0	gl	You can use the AutoFormat feature to quickly apply a format to a sheet or a selected cell range.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_idN10702				0	gl	To Apply an AutoFormat to a Sheet or Selected Cell Range				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_idN106CE				0	gl	Escolla as celas, incluídos os títulos de columnas e de filas, ás que desexa dar formato.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D5				0	gl	Escolla \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Formato - Formato automático\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autoformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3151242				0	gl	Para seleccionar as propiedades que se incluirán no Formato automático, prema en \<emph\>Máis\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
