helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_value.xhp	0	help	par_id3150010				0	gl	Para mostrar as fórmulas nas celas, por exemplo, no formato =SUMA(A1:B5), proceda da seguinte maneira:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_value.xhp	0	help	par_id3151116				0	gl	Choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Calc - View\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_value.xhp	0	help	par_id3146120				0	gl	Na área \<emph\>Mostrar\</emph\>, seleccione a caixa \<emph\>Fórmulas\</emph\>. Prema en Aceptar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_value.xhp	0	help	par_id3147396				0	gl	Para exportar os resultados do cálculo en vez das fórmulas, non marque \<emph\>Fórmulas\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\formula_value.xhp	0	help	par_id3153157				0	gl	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01060100.xhp\" name=\"Spreadsheet - View\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Calc - View\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
