helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3155429				0	gl	Seleccione as celas.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3149260				0	gl	Escolla \<emph\>Formato - Celas\</emph\> (ou \<emph\>Formatar celas\</emph\> no menú de contexto).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3152938				0	gl	Seleccione a cor de fondo no separador \<emph\>Fondo\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
