helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calculate.xhp	0	help	par_id3146120				0	gl	A seguir móstrase un exemplo de cálculo en $[officename] Calc.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calculate.xhp	0	help	par_id3153951				0	gl	Prema nunha cela e introduza un número.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calculate.xhp	0	help	par_idN10656				0	gl	Press Enter.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calculate.xhp	0	help	par_idN1065D				0	gl	O cursor descenderá ata a seguinte cela.				20200411 15:09:53
