helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3150955				0	gl	DAYSINMONTH(Date)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3147501				0	gl	\<emph\>Date\</emph\> is any date in the respective month of the desired year. The Date parameter must be a valid date according to the locale settings of %PRODUCTNAME.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149871				0	gl	Exemplo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3155742				0	gl	=DAYSINMONTH(A1) returns 29 days if A1 contains 1968-02-17, a valid date for February 1968.				20200411 15:09:53
