helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145237				0	gl	SEMANASPORANO				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3147410				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DAI_FUNC_WEEKSINYEAR\"\>Calculates the number of weeks of the year in which the date entered occurs.\</ahelp\> The number of weeks is defined as follows: a week that spans two years is added to the year in which most days of that week occur.				20200411 15:09:53
