helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140500.xhp	0	help	par_id3150767				0	gl	In contrast to copying an area to the clipboard, you can filter certain information and calculate values. This command is only visible if you have selected two sheets in the document. To select multiple sheets, click each sheet tab while pressing \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\> \<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\> \<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\> \</switchinline\> or Shift.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155131				0	gl	Filling a Sheet				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140500.xhp	0	help	par_id3146119				0	gl	Select the entire sheet by clicking the empty gray box in the upper left of the sheet. You can also select an area of the sheet to be copied.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140500.xhp	0	help	par_id3153726				0	gl	Press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\> \<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> and click the tab of the sheet where you want to insert the contents.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140500.xhp	0	help	par_id3147436				0	gl	Select the command \<emph\>Edit - Fill - Sheet\</emph\>. In the dialog which appears, the check box \<emph\>Numbers\</emph\> must be selected (or \<emph\>Paste All\</emph\>) if you want to combine operations with the values. You can also choose the desired operation here.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140500.xhp	0	help	par_id3154942				0	gl	Prema en \<emph\>Aceptar\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140500.xhp	0	help	par_id3156283				0	gl	This dialog is similar to the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/02070000.xhp\" name=\"Paste Contents\"\>Paste Contents\</link\> dialog, where you can find additional tips.				20200411 15:09:53
