helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147265				0	gl	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/05030300.xhp\" name=\"Hide\"\>Hide\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3156281				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Hide\"\>Hides selected rows, columns or individual sheets.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3148645	3			0	gl	Select the rows or columns that you want to hide, and then choose \<emph\>Format - Row - Hide \</emph\>or\<emph\> Format - Column - Hide\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3147427				0	gl	You can hide a sheet by selecting the sheet tab and then choosing \<emph\>Format - Sheet - Hide\</emph\>. Hidden sheets are not printed unless they occur within a \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/05080000.xhp\" name=\"print range\"\>print range\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153157				0	gl	A break in the row or column header indicates whether the row or column is hidden.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3145251				0	gl	To display hidden rows, columns or sheets				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id8337046				0	gl	Select the range that includes the hidden objects. You can also use the box in the corner above row 1 and beside column A. For sheets, this step is not necessary.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id5532090				0	gl	Choose \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/05030400.xhp\" name=\"Format - Row/Column - Show\"\>Format - Row/Column - Show\</link\> or \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/05050300.xhp\" name=\"Format - Sheet - Show\"\>Format - Sheet - Show\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
