helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150793				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FillUp\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Fills a selected range of at least two rows with the contents of the bottom most cell.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150447				0	gl	If a selected range has only one column, the content of the bottom most cell is copied into the selected cells. If several columns are selected, the contents of the bottom most cells are copied into those selected above.				20200411 15:09:53
