helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3154852				0	gl	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ISNA(D3)\</item\> returns FALSE as a result.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149426				0	gl	\<bookmark_value\>ISTEXT function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>cell contents;text\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
