helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3145368				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ISTTEXT\"\>Returns TRUE if the cell contents refer to text.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id6779686				0	gl	If an error occurs, the function returns FALSE.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154332				0	gl	Sintaxe				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3148649				0	gl	ISTEXT(Value)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3150417				0	gl	\<emph\>Value\</emph\> is a value, number, Boolean value, or an error value to be tested.				20200411 15:09:53
