helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149729				0	gl	\<bookmark_value\>COUNTA function\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>number of entries\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
