helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3146859	62			0	gl	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=BETAINV(0.5;5;10)\</item\> returns the value 0.33.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	bm_id3156096				0	gl	\<bookmark_value\>BETADIST function\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>cumulative probability density function;calculating\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
