helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3163314				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_SUMMENPRODUKT\"\>Multiplies corresponding elements in the given arrays, and returns the sum of those products.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
