helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3163347				0	gl	SUMPRODUCT(Array1; Array2...Array30)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3163362				0	gl	\<emph\>Array1, Array2...Array30\</emph\> represent arrays whose corresponding elements are to be multiplied.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_idN11B19				0	gl	At least one array must be part of the argument list. If only one array is given, all array elements are summed.				20200411 15:09:53
