helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_networkdays.xhp	0	help	par_id3153788				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_NETWORKDAYS\"\>Returns the number of workdays between a \<emph\>start date and an end date\</emph\>. Holidays can be deducted.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
