helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_weeknumadd.xhp	0	help	par_id3149973				0	gl	In which week number does 12.24.2001 fall?				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_weeknumadd.xhp	0	help	par_id3149914				0	gl	\<item type=\"input\"\>=WEEKNUM_ADD(24.12.2001;1)\</item\> returns 52.				20200411 15:09:53
