helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060183.xhp	0	help	par_id3149254				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_KRITBINOM\"\>Returns the smallest value for which the cumulative binomial distribution is less than or equal to a criterion value.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060183.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153930				0	gl	Sintaxe				20200411 15:09:53
