helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12080200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153561				0	gl	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/12080200.xhp\" name=\"Show Details\"\>Show Details\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12080200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153822				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ShowDetail\"\>Shows the details of the grouped row or column that contains the cursor. To show the details of all of the grouped rows or columns, select the outlined table, and then choose this command.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12080200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155922	3			0	gl	To hide a selected group, choose \<emph\>Data -Outline – \</emph\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/12080100.xhp\" name=\"Hide Details\"\>\<emph\>Hide Details\</emph\>\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12080200.xhp	0	help	par_id6036561				0	gl	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/12080700.xhp\"\>Show Details command in pivot tables\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
