helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149879				0	gl	\<bookmark_value\>NEGBINOMDIST function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>negative binomial distribution\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
