helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3153558				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ARABISCH\"\>Calculates the value of a Roman number. The value range must be between 0 and 3999.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
