helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3153546	18			0	gl	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=DOLLAR(255)\</item\> returns $255.00.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154635	19			0	gl	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=DOLLAR(367.456;2)\</item\> returns $367.46. Use the decimal separator that corresponds to the \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01140000.xhp\" name=\"current locale setting\"\>current locale setting\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
