helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	par_id3144759				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_VARIATIONEN2\"\>Returns the number of permutations for a given number of objects (repetition allowed).\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145598				0	gl	Sintaxe				20200411 15:09:53
