helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3153337				0	gl	\<emph\>Settlement\</emph\> is the date of purchase of the security.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3149051				0	gl	\<emph\>Maturity\</emph\> is the date on which the security matures (expires).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3147297				0	gl	\<emph\>Issue\</emph\> is the date of issue of the security.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3150393				0	gl	\<emph\>FirstCoupon\</emph\> is the first interest date of the security.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3147402				0	gl	\<emph\>Rate\</emph\> is the annual rate of interest.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3151387				0	gl	\<emph\>Yield\</emph\> is the annual yield of the security.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3153023				0	gl	\<emph\>Redemption\</emph\> is the redemption value per 100 currency units of par value.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3150539				0	gl	\<emph\>Frequency\</emph\> is number of interest payments per year (1, 2 or 4).				20200411 15:09:53
