helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3148618				0	gl	\<emph\>Settlement\</emph\> is the date of purchase of the security.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3148988				0	gl	\<emph\>Maturity\</emph\> is the date on which the security is sold.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3154604				0	gl	\<emph\>Investment\</emph\> is the purchase price.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3154337				0	gl	\<emph\>Redemption\</emph\> is the selling price.				20200411 15:09:53
