helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3149426				0	gl	A painting is bought on 1990-01-15 for 1 million and sold on 2002-05-05 for 2 million. The basis is daily balance calculation (basis = 3). What is the average annual level of interest?				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3151125				0	gl	=INTRATE("1990-01-15"; "2002-05-05"; 1000000; 2000000; 3) returns 8.12%.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148654				0	gl	\<bookmark_value\>COUPNCD function\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
