helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3150628				0	gl	\<emph\>Settlement\</emph\> is the date of purchase of the security.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3153536				0	gl	\<emph\>Maturity\</emph\> is the date on which the security matures (expires).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3145313				0	gl	\<emph\>Frequency\</emph\> is number of interest payments per year (1, 2 or 4).				20200411 15:09:53
