helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3154794				0	gl	A security is purchased on 2001-01-25; the date of maturity is 2001-11-15. Interest is paid half-yearly (frequency is 2). Using daily balance interest calculation (basis 3) when is the next interest date?				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3159251				0	gl	=COUPNCD("2001-01-25"; "2001-11-15"; 2; 3) returns 2001-05-15.				20200411 15:09:53
