helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3145158				0	gl	\<emph\>Period\</emph\> is the period, for which the compound interest is calculated. Period=NPER if compound interest for the last period is calculated.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3147577				0	gl	\<emph\>NPer\</emph\> is the total number of periods, during which annuity is paid.				20200411 15:09:53
