helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02150000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146134				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"SC_CHECKBOX_RID_SCDLG_DELCONT_BTN_DELATTRS\"\>Deletes format attributes applied to cells. All cell content remains unchanged.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
