helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id3158440	40			0	gl	Returns \<emph\>Number\</emph\>            \<emph\>!!\</emph\>, the double factorial of \<emph\>Number\</emph\>, where \<emph\>Number\</emph\> is an integer greater than or equal to zero.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id2480849				0	gl	For even numbers FACTDOUBLE(n) returns:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id4181951				0	gl	2*4*6*8* ... *n				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id2927335				0	gl	For odd numbers FACTDOUBLE(n) returns:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id2107303				0	gl	1*3*5*7* ... *n				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id4071779				0	gl	FACTDOUBLE(0) returns 1 by definition.				20200411 15:09:53
