helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3146944				0	gl	\<bookmark_value\>ABS function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>absolute values\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>values;absolute\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
