helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151017				0	gl	ACOSH(Number)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3149000	64			0	gl	 This function returns the inverse hyperbolic cosine of \<emph\>Number\</emph\>, that is the number whose hyperbolic cosine is Number. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id6393932				0	gl	 Number must be greater than or equal to 1.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150566				0	gl	Exemplo				20200411 15:09:53
