helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3154914				0	gl	If you enter the numbers \<item type=\"input\"\>512\</item\>;\<item type=\"input\"\>1024\</item\> and \<item type=\"input\"\>2000\</item\> in the Integer 1;2 and 3 text boxes, 128000 will be returned as the result.				20200411 15:09:53
