helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3165682				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_TEILERGEBNIS\"\>Calculates subtotals.\</ahelp\> If a range already contains subtotals, these are not used for further calculations. Use this function with the AutoFilters to take only the filtered records into account.				20200411 15:09:53
