helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3164404				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_WURZEL\"\>Returns the positive square root of a number.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3164424				0	gl	Sintaxe				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3164437				0	gl	SQRT(Number)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3164451				0	gl	Returns the positive square root of \<emph\>Number\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
