helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3164471				0	gl	Exemplo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3164484				0	gl	\<item type=\"input\"\>=SQRT(16)\</item\> returns 4.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3591723				0	gl	\<item type=\"input\"\>=SQRT(-16)\</item\> returns an \<item type=\"literal\"\>invalid argument\</item\> error.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3164560				0	gl	\<bookmark_value\>SQRTPI function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>square roots;products of Pi\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
