helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3149596				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_NOMINAL\"\>Calculates the yearly nominal interest rate, given the effective rate and the number of compounding periods per year.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151252				0	gl	Sintaxe				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3152769				0	gl	NOMINAL(EffectiveRate; NPerY)				20200411 15:09:53
