helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3156334				0	gl	\<emph\>NPerY\</emph\> is the number of periodic interest payments per year.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154473				0	gl	Exemplo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3147091				0	gl	What is the nominal interest per year for an effective interest rate of 13.5% if twelve payments are made per year.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3154831				0	gl	\<item type=\"input\"\>=NOMINAL(13.5%;12)\</item\> = 12.73%. The nominal interest rate per year is 12.73%.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155123				0	gl	\<bookmark_value\>NOMINAL_ADD function\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
