helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3148671				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_NOMINAL\"\>Calculates the annual nominal rate of interest on the basis of the effective rate and the number of interest payments per annum.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
