helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3153777				0	gl	\<emph\>EffectiveRate\</emph\> is the effective annual rate of interest.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3150409				0	gl	\<emph\>NPerY\</emph\> the number of interest payments per year.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146789				0	gl	Exemplo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3145777				0	gl	What is the nominal rate of interest for a 5.3543% effective rate of interest and quarterly payment.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3156146				0	gl	\<item type=\"input\"\>=NOMINAL_ADD(5.3543%;4)\</item\> returns 0.0525 or 5.25%.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	bm_id3159087				0	gl	\<bookmark_value\>DOLLARFR function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>converting;decimal fractions, into mixed decimal fractions\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
