helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3150593				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_DOLLARFR\"\>Converts a quotation that has been given as a decimal number into a mixed decimal fraction.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151106				0	gl	Sintaxe				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3152959				0	gl	DOLLARFR(DecimalDollar; Fraction)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3149558				0	gl	\<emph\>DecimalDollar\</emph\> is a decimal number.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3153672				0	gl	\<emph\>Fraction\</emph\> is a whole number that is used as the denominator of the decimal fraction.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156274				0	gl	Exemplo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3153795				0	gl	\<item type=\"input\"\>=DOLLARFR(1.125;16)\</item\> converts into sixteenths. The result is 1.02 for 1 plus 2/16.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3150995				0	gl	\<item type=\"input\"\>=DOLLARFR(1.125;8)\</item\> converts into eighths. The result is 1.1 for 1 plus 1/8.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154671				0	gl	\<bookmark_value\>fractions; converting\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>converting;decimal fractions, into decimal numbers\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>DOLLARDE function\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
