helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3154111				0	gl	\<emph\>FractionalDollar\</emph\> is a number given as a decimal fraction.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3153695				0	gl	\<emph\>Fraction\</emph\> is a whole number that is used as the denominator of the decimal fraction.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153884				0	gl	Exemplo				20200411 15:09:53
