helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3149309				0	gl	\<emph\>Settlement\</emph\> is the date of purchase of the security.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3151381				0	gl	\<emph\>Maturity\</emph\> is the date on which the security matures (expires).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3153302				0	gl	\<emph\>Issue\</emph\> is the date of issue of the security.				20200411 15:09:53
