helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153713				0	gl	The following data will be used in some of the function description examples:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155766				0	gl	The range A1:E10 lists the children invited to Joe's birthday party. The following information is given for each entry: column A shows the name, B the grade, then age in years, distance to school in meters and weight in kilograms.				20200411 15:09:53
