helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\03080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145785				0	gl	Text cells are formatted in black, formulas in green, and number cells in blue, no matter how their display is formatted.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\03080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153188				0	gl	If this function is active, colors that you define in the document will not be displayed. When you deactivate the function, the user-defined colors are displayed again.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\text2columns.xhp	0	help	tit				0	gl	Texto a columnas				20200411 15:09:53
