helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02190100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154366				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DeleteRowbreak\"\>Removes the manual row break above the active cell.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
