helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3159263				0	gl	As referencias cruzadas permiten ir a pasaxes concretas do texto e a obxectos dun só documento. As referencias cruzadas consisten nun destino e nunha referencia que se insiren no documento como \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/fields.xhp\" name=\"campos\"\>campos\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3155860				0	gl	Os obxectos con lendas e marcadores poden utilizarse como destinos.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149833				0	gl	Crear referencia cruzada para texto				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3149846				0	gl	Antes de inserir unha referencia cruzada debe especificar os destinos do texto.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156105				0	gl	To Insert a Target				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3153408				0	gl	Seleccione o texto que desexa utilizar como destino para a referencia cruzada.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3153125				0	gl	Escolla \<emph\>Inserir - Referencia cruzada\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3149634				0	gl	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> list, select “Set Reference”.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3149614				0	gl	Introduza un nome para o destino na caixa \<emph\>Nome\</emph\>. O texto seleccionado móstrase na caixa \<emph\>Valor\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3145110				0	gl	Click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert\</item\>. The name of the target is added to the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Selection\</item\> list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3156257				0	gl	Deixe a caixa de diálogo aberta e pase á sección seguinte.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153370				0	gl	To Create a Cross-Reference to a Target				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id7032074				0	gl	Position the cursor in the text where you want to insert a cross-reference.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id7796868				0	gl	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Cross-reference\</emph\> to open the dialog, if it is not open already.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3153392				0	gl	Na lista \<emph\>Tipo\</emph\>, seleccione "Inserir referencia".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3154256				0	gl	Na lista \<emph\>Selección\</emph\>, seleccione o destino para o cal desexa crear unha referencia cruzada.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3154856				0	gl	In the \<emph\>Insert reference to\</emph\> list, select the format for the cross-reference. The \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090002.xhp\" name=\"format\"\>format\</link\> specifies the type of information that is displayed as the cross-reference. For example, "Reference" inserts the target text, and "Page" inserts the page number where the target is located. For footnotes the footnote number is inserted.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3155895				0	gl	Prema en \<emph\>Inserir\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3148685				0	gl	Cando termine prema en \<emph\>Pechar\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149980				0	gl	Crear referencia cruzada para un obxecto				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3149992				0	gl	Pode crear referencias cruzadas para a maioría dos obxectos do documento, como imaxes, obxectos de debuxo, obxectos OLE e táboas, en tanto que posúan lendas. Para engadir unha lenda a un obxecto, seleccione o obxecto e escolla \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/captions.xhp\" name=\"Inserir - Lenda\"\>\<emph\>Inserir - Lenda\</emph\>\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3147123				0	gl	Prema no lugar do documento onde desexe inserir a referencia cruzada.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3150212				0	gl	Escolla \<emph\>Inserir - Referencia cruzada\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3150236				0	gl	Na lista \<emph\>Tipo\</emph\>, seleccione a categoría da lenda do obxecto.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3150942				0	gl	Na lista \<emph\>Selección\</emph\>, seleccione o número da lenda do obxecto para o cal desexa crear unha referencia cruzada.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3150968				0	gl	In the \<emph\>Insert reference to\</emph\> list, select the format of the cross-reference. The \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090002.xhp\" name=\"format\"\>format\</link\> specifies the type of information that is displayed as the cross-reference. For example, "Reference" inserts the caption category and caption text of the object.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3150535				0	gl	Prema en \<emph\>Inserir\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3151092				0	gl	Cando termine prema en \<emph\>Pechar\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
