helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3153594				0	gl	Para actualizar manualmente as referencias cruzadas dun documento prema en F9.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id7321390				0	gl	Choose \<emph\>View - Fields\</emph\> to switch between viewing the reference names and the reference contents.				20200411 15:09:53
