helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3153131				0	gl	Prema no documento e escolla \<emph\>Inserir - Campos - Outro\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3149640	21			0	gl	Prema no separador \<emph\>Variábeis\</emph\> e despois en "Definir variábel" na lista \<emph\>Tipo\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3149970	22			0	gl	Prema en "Xeral" na lista \<emph\>Formato\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3149620				0	gl	Type a name for the variable in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Name\</item\> box, for example, \<item type=\"literal\"\>Hide\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3149869				0	gl	Enter a value for the variable in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Value\</item\> box, for example, \<item type=\"literal\"\>1\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3145108				0	gl	Para ocultar a variábel seleccione \<emph\>Invisíbel\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3149585				0	gl	Click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert\</item\> and \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Close\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156245				0	gl	To Hide Text				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3145391				0	gl	Prema no lugar onde desexe engadir o texto.				20200411 15:09:53
