helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3154853				0	gl	Prema no parágrafo no cal desexa engadir o texto.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3154872	35			0	gl	Escolla \<emph\>Inserir - Campos - Outro\</emph\> e prema no separador \<emph\>Funcións\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3155902	6			0	gl	Prema en "Parágrafo oculto" na lista \<emph\>Tipo\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3155947				0	gl	Enter a statement in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Condition\</item\> box. For example, using the variable you previously defined, enter \<item type=\"literal\"\>Hide==1\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3149991				0	gl	Click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert\</item\> and \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Close\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3793450				0	gl	Debe activar este recurso eliminando a marca de verificación do menú \<emph\>Ver - Parágrafos ocultos\</emph\>. Se está marcado non pode ocultar ningún parágrafo.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148675				0	gl	To Hide a Section				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3148697				0	gl	Seleccione o texto que desexa ocultar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3153019				0	gl	Escolla \<emph\>Inserir - Sección\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3148950				0	gl	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Hide\</item\> area, select \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Hide\</item\>, and then enter an expression in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Condition\</item\> box. For example, using the variable you previously defined, enter \<item type=\"literal\"\>Hide==1\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3153636				0	gl	Click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
