helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_id3156097				0	gl	Escolla \<emph\>Formato - Estilos e formatado\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_id3153402				0	gl	Prema na icona da categoría de estilo que desexa crear.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_id3153119				0	gl	Prema no documento desde onde desexa copiar o estilo, por exemplo, nun parágrafo que formatara manualmente.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_id3153138				0	gl	Click the arrow next to the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>New Style from Selection\</item\> icon and choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>New Style from Selection\</item\> from the submenu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_id3156260				0	gl	Type a name in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Style Name\</item\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_id3154411				0	gl	Prema en \<emph\>Aceptar\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153373				0	gl	To Create a New Style by Drag-And-Drop				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_id3154233				0	gl	Escolla \<emph\>Formato - Estilos e formatado\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_id3154258				0	gl	Prema na icona da categoría de estilo que desexa crear.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_id3154851				0	gl	Seleccione polo menos un carácter ou obxecto do estilo que desexa copiar. Para os estilos de páxina e de marco, seleccione polo menos un carácter ou obxecto da páxina ou marco.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_id3154871				0	gl	Arrastre o carácter ou obxecto ata Estilos e formatado.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_idN107B2				0	gl	For paragraph and character styles, you can drag-and-drop onto the respective icon in the Styles and Formatting window. You do not need to open that style category in advance.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_idN107B5				0	gl	Tamén pode arrastrar e soltar un marco na xanela Estilos e formatado para crear un novo estilo de marco. Prema no marco e, sen mover o rato, agarde un momento co botón premido. A continuación, arrástreo á xanela Estilos e formatado e sólteo na icona Estilos de marco.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fromselect.xhp	0	help	par_id3149988				0	gl	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05140000.xhp\" name=\"Estilos e formatado\"\>Estilos e formatado\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
