helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text2.xhp	0	help	par_id3150513				0	gl	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Fields - Page Count\</item\>, and then enter a space.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text2.xhp	0	help	par_id3150537				0	gl	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Fields - Other\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Functions\</item\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text2.xhp	0	help	par_id3153166				0	gl	Click "Conditional text" in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text2.xhp	0	help	par_id3145256				0	gl	Type \<item type=\"literal\"\>Page > 1\</item\> in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Condition\</item\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text2.xhp	0	help	par_id3145280				0	gl	Type \<item type=\"literal\"\>Pages\</item\> in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Then\</item\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
