helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	par_idN1065F				0	gl	\<variable id=\"ruler\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/ruler.xhp\"\>Utilización das regras\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	par_idN1067D				0	gl	To show or hide rulers, choose \<emph\>View - Ruler\</emph\>. To show the vertical ruler, choose \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040200.xhp\" name=\"Writer - View\"\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - View\</emph\>\</link\>, and then select \<emph\>Vertical ruler\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Ruler\</emph\> area.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149686				0	gl	Axuste de marxes de páxina				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	par_id3155175				0	gl	As áreas cheas ao final das regras indican as marxes da páxina.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149038				0	gl	Modificación de sangrías				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	par_id3153631				0	gl	As sangrías axústanse cos tres pequenos rectángulos da regra horizontal.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	par_id3152776	26			0	gl	Para modificar a sangría do parágrafo esquerdo ou dereito, seleccione o(s) parágrafo(s) que desexe e arrastre o triángulo inferior esquerdo ou dereito na regra horizontal a unha nova posición.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	par_id3145769				0	gl	Para modificar a sangría da primeira liña dun parágrafo seleccionado, arrastre o triángulo superior esquerdo na regra horizontal a unha nova posición.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	par_id3149164				0	gl	Tamén pode premer dúas veces en calquera lugar da regra horizontal e axustar as sangrías na caixa de diálogo \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030000.xhp\" name=\"Parágrafo\"\>\<emph\>Parágrafo\</emph\>\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	tit				0	gl	Protecting Content in %PRODUCTNAME Writer				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150620				0	gl	\<bookmark_value\>indexes;unprotecting\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>tables of contents;unprotecting\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>tables;protecting/unprotecting cells\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>sections;protecting/unprotecting\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>unprotecting tables of contents and indexes\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>protecting;tables and sections\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>cells;protecting/unprotecting\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	hd_id6007263				0	gl	\<variable id=\"protection\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/protection.xhp\" name=\"Protecting Content in %PRODUCTNAME Writer\"\>Protecting Content in \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer\</item\>\</link\> \</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	par_id1924802				0	gl	The following is an overview of the different ways of protecting contents in \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Writer from being modified, deleted or viewed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150114				0	gl	Protexer seccións en \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Writer				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	par_id3150592				0	gl	As seccións dos documentos de texto de \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Writer poden protexerse contra os cambios mediante un contrasinal.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	par_id4545426				0	gl	This protection is not intended to be a secure protection. It is just a switch to protect the section against accidental changes.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	par_id3166413				0	gl	Activar a protección				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	par_id3144764				0	gl	Seleccione o texto e escolla \<emph\>Inserir - Sección - Sección\</emph\> e marque as caixas de verificación \<emph\>Protexer\</emph\> e \<emph\>Con contrasinal\</emph\> situadas en \<emph\>Protección contra escrita\</emph\>. (Se a sección xa existe: \<emph\>Formato - Seccións\</emph\>.) Introduza e confirme un contrasinal de, como mínimo, 5 caracteres.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	par_id3147497				0	gl	Desactivar a protección				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	par_id3147173				0	gl	Escolla \<emph\>Formato - Sección - Sección\</emph\> e desmarque a caixa de verificación \<emph\>Protexer\</emph\> situada en \<emph\>Protección contra escrita\</emph\>. Introduza o contrasinal correcto.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146081				0	gl	Protexer celas en táboas de \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Writer				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	par_id3154480				0	gl	Pode protexer o contido de celas individuais das táboas de texto de \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Writer contra os cambios.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	par_id363170				0	gl	This protection is not intended to be a secure protection. It is just a switch to protect the cells against accidental changes.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	par_id3154360				0	gl	Activar a protección				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	par_id3145643				0	gl	Sitúe o cursor nunha cela ou seleccione as celas. Escolla \<emph\>Formato - Cela - Protexer\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	par_id3150042				0	gl	Desactivar a protección				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	par_id3155178				0	gl	Place the cursor in the cell or select the cells. First, if necessary, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - Formatting Aids\</emph\> and mark \<emph\>Cursor in protected areas - Enable\</emph\>. Then right-click the cell to open the context menu, choose \<emph\>Cell - Unprotect\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	par_id3151189				0	gl	Seleccione a táboa no navegador, abra o menú de contexto e seleccione \<emph\>Táboa - Desprotexer\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	par_id3147322				0	gl	Use Maiús+Ctrl+T para eliminar a protección da táboa actual ou das seleccionadas.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149259				0	gl	Protección automática de índices				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	par_id3153966				0	gl	As táboas de contidos e os índices creados automaticamente en textos de \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Writer protéxense de forma automática contra os cambios involuntarios.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	par_id814539				0	gl	This protection is not intended to be a secure protection. It is just a switch to protect the contents against accidental changes.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	par_id3145767				0	gl	Activar a protección				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	par_id3153786				0	gl	Sitúe o cursor no contido do índice.				20200411 15:09:53
