helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_animation.xhp	0	help	par_id3149819				0	gl	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Effect\</item\> box, select the animation that you want.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_animation.xhp	0	help	par_id3145786				0	gl	Defina as propiedades do efecto e prema en \<emph\>Aceptar\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	tit				0	gl	Working with Master Documents and Subdocuments				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145246				0	gl	\<bookmark_value\>Navigator;master documents\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>master documents;creating/editing/exporting\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>subdocuments;creating/editing/removing\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>removing;subdocuments\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>indexes; master documents\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145246				0	gl	\<variable id=\"globaldoc_howtos\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/globaldoc_howtos.xhp\"\>Working with Master Documents and Subdocuments\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	par_id1522873				0	gl	Un documento principal permite administrar documentos grandes, como un libro con moitos capítulos. O documento principal pódese ver como un recipiente para ficheiros individuais de \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Writer, chamados subdocumentos.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153127				0	gl	To Create a Master Document				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	par_id3149634				0	gl	Adopte un dos procedementos seguintes:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	par_id3149956				0	gl	Choose \<emph\>File - New - Master Document\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	par_id3149612				0	gl	Open an existing document and choose \<emph\>File - Send - Create Master Document\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	par_id3149873				0	gl	If you are creating a new master document, the first entry in the Navigator should be a \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Text\</item\> entry. Type an introduction or enter some text. This ensures that after having edited an existing style in the master document, you see the changed style when viewing the subdocuments.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	par_id3145114				0	gl	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Navigator\</item\> for master documents (should open automatically, else press F5 to open), click and hold the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert\</item\> icon, and do one of the following:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	par_id3156240				0	gl	To insert an existing file as a subdocument, choose \<emph\>File\</emph\>, locate the file that you want to include, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	par_id3145405				0	gl	To create a new subdocument, choose \<emph\>New Document\</emph\>, type a name for the file, and then click \<emph\>Save\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	par_id8550981				0	gl	To insert some text between subdocuments, choose \<emph\>Text\</emph\>. Then type the text. You cannot insert text next to an existing text entry in the Navigator.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	par_id3153382				0	gl	Escolla \<emph\>Ficheiro - Gardar\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154242				0	gl	To Edit a Master Document				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	par_id3154255				0	gl	Utilice o Navegador para reorganizar e editar os subdocumentos.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	par_id3155879				0	gl	Prema dúas veces no nome do subdocumento no navegador para editalo. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	par_id3155931				0	gl	Para eliminar un subdocumento do documento principal, prema co botón dereito na lista do navegador e escolla \<emph\>Eliminar\</emph\>. O subdocumento non é eliminado, só é eliminada a entrada no navegador.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	par_id3148677				0	gl	To add text to a master document, right-click an item in the Navigator list, and then choose \<emph\>Insert - Text\</emph\>. A text section is inserted before the selected item in the master document where you can type the text that you want. You cannot insert text next to an existing text entry in the Navigator.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	par_id3149982				0	gl	To reorder the subdocuments in a master document, drag a subdocument to a new location in the Navigator list. You can also select a subdocument in the list, and click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Move down\</item\> or \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Move up\</item\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	par_id3153022				0	gl	Para engadir un índice, prema o botón dereito na lista do navegador e, a seguir, escolla  \<emph\>Inserir - Índice\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	par_id3148949				0	gl	\<image id=\"img_id3148959\" src=\"sw/imglst/sc20246.png\" width=\"0.1862in\" height=\"0.1862in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3148959\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	par_id3153632				0	gl	Para actualizar un índice do documento principal, seleccióneo no Navegador e prema na icona \<emph\>Actualizar\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	par_idN10C40				0	gl	Cando insira un obxecto no documento principal, como un marco ou unha imaxe, non o ancore "á páxina". Defina a áncora "ao parágrafo" no separador \<emph\>Formato - (Tipo de obxecto) - Tipo\</emph\> e defina a súa posición relativa á "Páxina completa" nas caixas de lista \<emph\>Horizontal\</emph\> e \<emph\>Vertical\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153656				0	gl	To Start Each Subdocument on a New Page				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	par_id3152760				0	gl	Asegúrese de iniciar cada subdocumento cun título que utilice o mesmo estilo de parágrafo, por exemplo "Título 1".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	par_id3153876				0	gl	No documento principal escolla \<emph\>Formato - Estilos e formatado\</emph\> e prema na icona \<emph\>Estilos de parágrafos\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	par_id3153907				0	gl	Prema co botón dereito do rato en "Título 1" e escolla \<emph\>Modificar\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	par_id3147124				0	gl	Click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Text Flow\</item\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	par_id3149770				0	gl	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Breaks\</item\> area, select \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert\</item\>, and then select “Page” in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	par_id3150224				0	gl	Se quere que cada subdocumento comece nunha páxina impar, seleccione \<emph\>Con estilo de páxina\</emph\> e escolla "Páxina á dereita" na caixa.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	par_id3145205				0	gl	Prema en \<emph\>Aceptar\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145228				0	gl	To Export a Master Document as a \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Text Document				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	par_id3150315				0	gl	Escolla \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Ficheiro - Exportar\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	par_id3148580				0	gl	Na lista \<emph\>Formato de ficheiro\</emph\>, seleccione un formato e prema \<emph\>Exportar\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\globaldoc_howtos.xhp	0	help	par_id8371227				0	gl	Os subdocumentos expórtanse como seccións. Utilice \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Formato - Seccións\</item\> para desprotexer e eliminar as seccións, se prefire un texto plano sen seccións.				20200411 15:09:53
