helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagenumbers.xhp	0	help	par_id5947141				0	gl	Se escolle \<emph\>Inserir - Quebra manual\</emph\>, pode inserir unha quebra de páxina con ou sen modificación de estilo ou con modificación de número de páxina.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagenumbers.xhp	0	help	par_id1911679				0	gl	It depends on your document what is best: to use a manually inserted page break between page styles, or to use an automatic change. If you just need one title page with a different style than the other pages, you can use the automatic method:				20200411 15:09:53
