helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_page.xhp	0	help	par_id3148473				0	gl	In Writer, you define borders for \<emph\>page styles\</emph\>, not individual pages. All changes made to borders apply to all pages that use the same page style. Note that page style changes cannot be undone by the Undo function in $[officename].				20200411 15:09:53
