helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\templates_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3149635				0	gl	A template is a document that contains specific formatting styles, graphics, tables, objects, and other information. A template is used as the basis for creating other documents. For example, you can define paragraph and character styles in a document, save the document as a template, and then use the template to create a new document with the same styles.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\templates_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3149957				0	gl	A menos que especifique o contrario, os novos documentos de texto de $[officename] están baseados no modelo predefinido.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\templates_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3149974				0	gl	$[officename] posúe varios \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05130000.xhp\" name=\"modelos predefinidos\"\>modelos predefinidos\</link\> que pode usar para crear diferentes tipos de documentos de texto, como cartas comerciais.				20200411 15:09:53
