helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3149602				0	gl	Escolla \<emph\>Inserir - Marco\</emph\> e prema en Aceptar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145115				0	gl	To Edit a Text Frame				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3149578				0	gl	Para editar o contido dun marco de texto, prema no marco e faga as modificacións que desexe.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3156239				0	gl	Para editar un marco, seleccióneo, prema co botón dereito do rato e escolla unha opción de formatado. Tamén pode premer co botón dereito do rato no marco seleccionado e escoller \<emph\>Marco\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3156261				0	gl	To resize a text frame, click an edge of the frame, and drag one of the edges or corners of the frame. Hold down Shift while you drag to maintain the proportion of the frame.				20200411 15:09:53
