helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3154262				0	gl	Pode definir calquera marco de texto nun modo que permita mostrar o texto na pantalla mais que o oculte na impresión.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3154858				0	gl	Seleccione o marco de texto (ve as oito agarradoiras).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3155875				0	gl	Choose \<emph\>Format - Frame/Object - Options\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
