helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147691				0	gl	\<bookmark_value\>inserting; captions\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>captions; inserting and editing\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>editing;captions\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>objects; captioning\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>tables; labeling\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>frames; labeling\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>charts; labeling\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>text frames; labeling\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>draw objects; inserting captions\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>legends, see also captions\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150537				0	gl	\<variable id=\"captions\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/captions.xhp\" name=\"Using Captions\"\>Using Captions\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	par_id3153156				0	gl	Nos documentos de texto pode engadir lendas con numeración secuencial a imaxes, táboas, marcos e obxectos de debuxo.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	par_id3153172				0	gl	Pode editar o texto e os intervalos numéricos de tipos de lendas diferentes.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	par_id3153186				0	gl	Cando engade unha lenda a unha imaxe ou obxecto, a imaxe e o texto da lenda colócanse xuntos nun novo marco. Cando engade unha lenda a unha táboa, o texto da lenda insírese como un parágrafo ao lado da táboa. Cando engade unha lenda a un marco, o texto da lenda engádese ao texto que se encontra dentro do marco, antes ou despois do texto xa existente.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	par_idN10713				0	gl	Para mover o obxecto e a lenda, arrastre o seu marco. Para actualizar a numeración das lendas despois de mover o marco, prema en F9.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155541				0	gl	To define a caption proceed as follows:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	par_id3155567				0	gl	Seleccione o elemento ao cal desexa engadir unha lenda.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	par_id3155586				0	gl	Escolla \<emph\>Inserir - Lenda\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	par_id3147765				0	gl	Select the options that you want, and then click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>OK\</item\>. If you want, you can also enter different text in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Category\</item\> box, for example \<item type=\"literal\"\>Figure\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	par_id3147254				0	gl	Pode editar o texto da lenda directamente no documento.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	par_id3147271				0	gl	A caption is formatted with the paragraph style that matches the name of the caption category. For example, if you insert a "Table" caption, the "Table" paragraph style is applied to the caption text.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions.xhp	0	help	par_id3145671				0	gl	$[officename] can automatically add a caption when you insert an object, graphic, frame, or table. Choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - AutoCaption\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intable.xhp	0	help	tit				0	gl	Calcular totais de celas en táboas				20200411 15:09:53
