helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3147084				0	gl	To apply a background color to a text paragraph within a cell, place the cursor into the text paragraph, then click the color on the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Background Color\</item\> toolbar.				20200411 15:09:53
