helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150211				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:UpdateAllIndexes\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Update all indexes and tables of contents in the current document. You do not need to place the cursor in an index or table before you use this command.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
