helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149824				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_METRICFIELD_TP_SECTION_INDENTS_MF_BEFORE\"\>Specifies the indents before the section, at the left margin.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
