helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3145412				0	gl	Parágrafo oculto: Oculta o parágrafo se a condición é verdadeira.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147515				0	gl	Calquera rexistro e Rexistro seguinte: Controla o acceso aos rexistros da base de datos.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149802	18			0	gl	The simplest way to define a condition is to type the logical expression directly in a \<emph\>Condition \</emph\>box using the following values:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153677				0	gl	VERDADEIRO				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3152960				0	gl	Sempre se cumpre a condición. Pódese introducir tamén calquera valor diferente de 0 como texto condicional.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155900				0	gl	FALSO				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154191				0	gl	Non se cumpre a condición. Pódese introducir tamén o valor 0.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147090	23			0	gl	If you leave the \<emph\>Condition \</emph\>box empty, the condition is interpreted as not being met.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3148980				0	gl	When you define a condition, use the same \<link href=\"text/swriter/02/14020000.xhp\"\>elements\</link\> for defining a formula, namely comparative operators, mathematical and statistical functions, number formats, variables and constants.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153638				0	gl	Pode utilizar os seguintes tipos de variábel:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155135				0	gl	Predefined \<link href=\"text/swriter/02/14020000.xhp\"\>$[officename] variables\</link\> that use statistics on document properties				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3156273				0	gl	Variábeis personalizadas creadas mediante o campo "Definir variábel"				20200411 15:09:53
