helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153589	146			0	gl	In the \<emph\>Condition \</emph\>box, type: "Addressbook.addresses.firstname".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153615	80			0	gl	In the \<emph\>Then \</emph\>box, type a space and leave the \<emph\>Or \</emph\>box blank.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153562				0	gl	Agora, pode utilizar unha condición para inserir texto baseado no contido do campo Nome.				20200411 15:09:53
