helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148768				0	gl	Editar ficheiro de concordancia				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3151180				0	gl	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_CREATE_AUTOMARK\"\>Create or edit a list of words to include in an Alphabetical Index.\</ahelp\> A concordance file lists words that should be referenced in an alphabetical index, together with the page number(s) where they appear in the document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id837427				0	gl	You can use the Find All button on the Find & Replace dialog to highlight all places where a word appears, then open the Insert Index Entry dialog to add that word and places to the alphabetical index. However, if you need the same set of alphabetical indexes in multiple documents, the concordance file allows to enter every word just once, then use the list many times.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154645				0	gl	Para acceder á caixa de diálogo Editar ficheiro de concordancia:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3149292				0	gl	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Indexes and Tables - Indexes and Tables - Index/Table\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3145420	21			0	gl	In the \<emph\>Type \</emph\>box, select "Alphabetical Index".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3154107	22			0	gl	In the \<emph\>Options \</emph\>area, select the \<emph\>Concordance file\</emph\> check box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3153668				0	gl	Click the \<emph\>File\</emph\> button, and then choose \<emph\>New\</emph\> or \<emph\>Edit\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3154470	24			0	gl	Os ficheiros de concordancia conteñen os seguintes campos:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3152953				0	gl	A opción "Termo de busca" refírese á entrada de índice que desexa marcar no documento.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3155896				0	gl	A opción "Entrada alternativa" refírese á entrada de índice que debe aparecer no índice.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3154194				0	gl	A primeira e a segunda chave son entradas superiores de índice. "Termo de busca" ou "Entrada alternativa" aparecen como subentrada so a primeira e a segunda chave.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3155184				0	gl	O campo "Diferenciar maiúsculas de minúsculas" indica que se fai distinción entre letras maiúsculas e minúsculas.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3143282				0	gl	A opción "Só palabra" busca o termo como unha única palabra.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3147220				0	gl	Para activar as opcións "Diferenciar maiúsculas de minúsculas" ou "Só palabra", prema na cela correspondente e, a seguir, marque a caixa de verificación.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153629				0	gl	Para crear un ficheiro de concordancia sen utilizar a caixa de diálogo Editar ficheiro de concordancia:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3153644				0	gl	Cando cree ficheiros de concordancia utilice as seguintes directrices de formato:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3152770				0	gl	As entradas do ficheiro de concordancia deben estar en liñas separadas.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3155142				0	gl	As liñas comentadas comezan por #.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3153354				0	gl	Utilice o seguinte formato para as entradas:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3149172				0	gl	Termo de busca;Entrada alternativa;Primeira chave;Segunda chave;Diferenciar maiúsculas de minúsculas;Só palabra				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3156270				0	gl	As entradas "Diferenciar maiúsculas de minúsculas" e "Só palabra" interprétanse como "Non" ou FALSE se están baleiras ou son cero (0). Os demais contidos interprétanse como "Si" ou TRUE.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145778				0	gl	Exemplo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3155907				0	gl	Por exemplo, para incluír a palabra "Ourense" no índice alfabético dentro da entrada "Cidades", introduza a seguinte liña no ficheiro de concordancia:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3151370				0	gl	Ourense;Ourense;Cidades;;0;0				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3151383				0	gl	Este procedemento tamén localiza a palabra "Ourense" se está escrita con letras minúsculas.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3155866				0	gl	Para incluír o barrio "O Couto" da cidade de Ourense dentro da entrada "Cidades", introduza a seguinte liña:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3150116	18			0	gl	O Couto;Ourense;Cidades;				20200411 15:09:53
