helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3147524				0	gl	Inserts a text field that is hidden when the condition that you specify is met. To use this function, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040600.xhp\" name=\"Text Document - Formatting Aids\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - Formatting Aids\</link\>\</emph\> and clear the \<emph\>Fields: Hidden text\</emph\> check box.				20200411 15:09:53
