helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153678				0	gl	To edit a frame, click the border to select it, and then choose \<emph\>Format - Frame/Object\</emph\>. You can also resize or move a selected frame using special \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04130100.xhp\" name=\"shortcut keys\"\>shortcut keys\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152952				0	gl	Para eliminar un marco, prema no seu bordo e, a seguir, prema en Eliminar.				20200411 15:09:53
